(4416550, 635182, 88010, '<td valign="top">dof to shallow</td>', 'dof to shallow', '2008-01-23 06:28:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4416551, 635842, 88204, '<td valign="top">I love the idea of a dreamy, fuzzy memory shot (was it with a Lens Baby?). The subject, however, doesn''t seem like something that would be that fuzzy memory. In other words, I don''t think this would be an image that stands out in my mind. Maybe it would be something like Grandma''s house or a favorite toy or something. Anyway, great idea, nice color, cool dreamy technique, still a cool subject and fun to look at and figure out. 8</td>', 'I love the idea of a dreamy, fuzzy memory shot (was it with a Lens Baby?). The subject, however, doesn''t seem like something that would be that fuzzy memory. In other words, I don''t think this would be an image that stands out in my mind. Maybe it would be something like Grandma''s house or a favorite toy or something. Anyway, great idea, nice color, cool dreamy technique, still a cool subject and fun to look at and figure out. 8', '2008-01-23 06:29:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4416553, 637037, 55892, '<td valign="top">Great concept, but I think it could be improved using a different angle.  The gap between the 2nd &amp; 3rd seats distracts from the composition.  Also,  the dark support poles atre distracting.  I wonder how this would look in black &amp; white.</td>', 'Great concept, but I think it could be improved using a different angle.  The gap between the 2nd & 3rd seats distracts from the composition.  Also,  the dark support poles atre distracting.  I wonder how this would look in black & white.', '2008-01-23 06:30:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4416554, 634596, 77543, '<td valign="top">it''s blurred</td>', 'it''s blurred', '2008-01-23 06:30:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4416555, 637085, 88204, '<td valign="top">A little contrived for me. I like the textures and the contrast of wood, brick and plaster. Hobbes doesn''t really add much to the shot. It got me thinking about having to sit in the corner for bad behavior.</td>', 'A little contrived for me. I like the textures and the contrast of wood, brick and plaster. Hobbes doesn''t really add much to the shot. It got me thinking about having to sit in the corner for bad behavior.', '2008-01-23 06:30:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4416557, 634897, 88204, '<td valign="top">I like the repeating posts and the stair step effect. Background is distracting and the lighting is flat. Might have been cool to do a low angle from the lower left of your shot, looking up the equipment. You might have gotten more out of those square grates... possibly a close up of one of them.</td>', 'I like the repeating posts and the stair step effect. Background is distracting and the lighting is flat. Might have been cool to do a low angle from the lower left of your shot, looking up the equipment. You might have gotten more out of those square grates... possibly a close up of one of them.', '2008-01-23 06:32:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4416560, 636991, 88204, '<td valign="top">Ah yes, coins on the tracks! I like the contrast and color in the image. I think I''d like it better if I was a little closer and not looking straight down on it. Interesting texture and color on the track but a little hard to make out.</td>', 'Ah yes, coins on the tracks! I like the contrast and color in the image. I think I''d like it better if I was a little closer and not looking straight down on it. Interesting texture and color on the track but a little hard to make out.', '2008-01-23 06:34:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4416562, 634382, 88204, '<td valign="top">Wow... this is s seriously scarred teddy! Great contrasting color. I love the way the texture of the bear and blanket work together. Lighting is a little harsh with strong shadows. Great subject but I think you could have gotten more from it.</td>', 'Wow... this is s seriously scarred teddy! Great contrasting color. I love the way the texture of the bear and blanket work together. Lighting is a little harsh with strong shadows. Great subject but I think you could have gotten more from it.', '2008-01-23 06:36:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4416564, 636834, 88010, '<td valign="top">I think vignettes make photo''s look cheap.</td>', 'I think vignettes make photo''s look cheap.', '2008-01-23 06:37:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4416566, 637091, 88010, '<td valign="top">Very nice. The best I''ve seen so far, including mine.</td>', 'Very nice. The best I''ve seen so far, including mine.', '2008-01-23 06:38:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4416567, 635716, 88204, '<td valign="top">Interesting house, although it doesn''t scream childhood at me. The bird bath right in the center is distracting. I can''t tell which I should look at. You might have used the sidewalk as more of a leading line. Seems like too much background too. I like the color of the pink house and deep blue sky.</td>', 'Interesting house, although it doesn''t scream childhood at me. The bird bath right in the center is distracting. I can''t tell which I should look at. You might have used the sidewalk as more of a leading line. Seems like too much background too. I like the color of the pink house and deep blue sky.', '2008-01-23 06:39:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4416569, 636083, 55892, '<td valign="top">Not enough contrast between background &amp; subject.</td>', 'Not enough contrast between background & subject.', '2008-01-23 06:39:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4416570, 637075, 88204, '<td valign="top">B&amp;W is a great choice for this shot. Well-weathered equipment. I think I''d like it if I could see more of the great texture on the see-saw. I don''t think you needed to get the whole see-saw in the picture to give the idea, so maybe a closer up view.</td>', 'B&W is a great choice for this shot. Well-weathered equipment. I think I''d like it if I could see more of the great texture on the see-saw. I don''t think you needed to get the whole see-saw in the picture to give the idea, so maybe a closer up view.', '2008-01-23 06:40:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4416573, 637067, 88204, '<td valign="top">The motion really catches my eye (not sure how you did it). Nice use of bright colors isolated by the background. I''m not sure why the blocks are flying across a blank frame so it feels a little contrived but still a nice shot.</td>', 'The motion really catches my eye (not sure how you did it). Nice use of bright colors isolated by the background. I''m not sure why the blocks are flying across a blank frame so it feels a little contrived but still a nice shot.', '2008-01-23 06:42:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4416575, 634178, 77543, '<td valign="top">I don''t see how this meets the challenge. Perhaps it represents a personal memory you have.</td>', 'I don''t see how this meets the challenge. Perhaps it represents a personal memory you have.', '2008-01-23 06:42:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4416577, 637096, 55892, '<td valign="top">Yellow popsicle stick handles?</td>', 'Yellow popsicle stick handles?', '2008-01-23 06:43:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4416578, 636982, 88204, '<td valign="top">I like the off center composition. Dolls are kind of creepy when you look closely at them. Nice even lighting and simple background. I wonder if you could have made this even lighter to make it even more high-key, possibly even give it a white vignette (can you do that in basic editing?).</td>', 'I like the off center composition. Dolls are kind of creepy when you look closely at them. Nice even lighting and simple background. I wonder if you could have made this even lighter to make it even more high-key, possibly even give it a white vignette (can you do that in basic editing?).', '2008-01-23 06:44:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4416580, 636849, 88204, '<td valign="top">Ooh... very striking contrast, composition and texture. I like the stone, string and metal...  round cans, jagged stone and twist of string. Striking. Also a good childhood memory.</td>', 'Ooh... very striking contrast, composition and texture. I like the stone, string and metal...  round cans, jagged stone and twist of string. Striking. Also a good childhood memory.', '2008-01-23 06:45:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4416586, 636965, 88204, '<td valign="top">Ah yes, the big pile of stuffed animals. I recall doing that with my own animals. I notice that I can see faces on 4 dolls/animals but not on the others. That might have been a good place to be more intentional... either show one doll''s face or many dolls'' faces. My eye is attracted to the elephant, the slightly blurred lion  and the pooh bear in the back. The color of the lighting seems very "indoor".</td>', 'Ah yes, the big pile of stuffed animals. I recall doing that with my own animals. I notice that I can see faces on 4 dolls/animals but not on the others. That might have been a good place to be more intentional... either show one doll''s face or many dolls'' faces. My eye is attracted to the elephant, the slightly blurred lion  and the pooh bear in the back. The color of the lighting seems very "indoor".', '2008-01-23 06:48:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4416587, 636822, 88204, '<td valign="top">Great color, nice close up. The line of colors leads my eye from the front to the back. Might be nice to have a little more diagonal flow.</td>', 'Great color, nice close up. The line of colors leads my eye from the front to the back. Might be nice to have a little more diagonal flow.', '2008-01-23 06:49:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4416589, 636742, 88204, '<td valign="top">Cool subject. Nice color on the books and lack of color in the background. Fence is a little distracting... was there an angle to avoid the fence?</td>', 'Cool subject. Nice color on the books and lack of color in the background. Fence is a little distracting... was there an angle to avoid the fence?', '2008-01-23 06:50:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4416592, 636865, 88204, '<td valign="top">Whites deema bit grey. I like the stream of light coming from the left but the subject doesn''t hold my interest. I wish I could see the face of the subject better.</td>', 'Whites deema bit grey. I like the stream of light coming from the left but the subject doesn''t hold my interest. I wish I could see the face of the subject better.', '2008-01-23 06:51:39.000000', NULL, 1),
