(4416597, 635750, 88204, '<td valign="top">Great texture. Love the B&amp;W. The swinging swing with no child gets me thinking.</td>', 'Great texture. Love the B&W. The swinging swing with no child gets me thinking.', '2008-01-23 06:53:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4416601, 635513, 88204, '<td valign="top">I like the color and contrast. It reminds me of prints in an old suitcase from the 70s. Subject seems a little contrived... I think I''d like the shot better exactly as you have it without the person.</td>', 'I like the color and contrast. It reminds me of prints in an old suitcase from the 70s. Subject seems a little contrived... I think I''d like the shot better exactly as you have it without the person.', '2008-01-23 06:55:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4416605, 634759, 88204, '<td valign="top">The image seems pretty ordinary. The title doesn''t quite pull it together for me. I wonder if there''s a slightly more dramatic presentation of the school, i.e. a very wide lens with an angle closer to the ground or something.</td>', 'The image seems pretty ordinary. The title doesn''t quite pull it together for me. I wonder if there''s a slightly more dramatic presentation of the school, i.e. a very wide lens with an angle closer to the ground or something.', '2008-01-23 06:56:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4416608, 636757, 88204, '<td valign="top">Great memory. I like the minimal color, repeating elements, simplicity. Very antique looking. The arrangement of men sort of leads me into the shot. My eye is attracted the soldiers in the front right. The guns pointed at them helps to lead my eye there too.</td>', 'Great memory. I like the minimal color, repeating elements, simplicity. Very antique looking. The arrangement of men sort of leads me into the shot. My eye is attracted the soldiers in the front right. The guns pointed at them helps to lead my eye there too.', '2008-01-23 06:58:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4416611, 637076, 88204, '<td valign="top">Great use of color. I like the cookie on end. Very nice lighting. I like the milk glass out of focus. Interesting glass choice for composition (although my mom never let me drink out of the fancy glasses).</td>', 'Great use of color. I like the cookie on end. Very nice lighting. I like the milk glass out of focus. Interesting glass choice for composition (although my mom never let me drink out of the fancy glasses).', '2008-01-23 07:00:06.000000', NULL, 1),
