(4417088, 635320, 86447, '<td valign="top">The use of a flash makes this less desirable as a photograph to me... but it does make it seem like it''s night and the child left her shoes and went to bed.<br/> <br/>I think I''d prefer it without such an obvious flash.</td>', 'The use of a flash makes this less desirable as a photograph to me... but it does make it seem like it''s night and the child left her shoes and went to bed. I think I''d prefer it without such an obvious flash.', '2008-01-23 09:46:06.000000', NULL, 1),
