(4417129, 637072, 86447, '<td valign="top">Although the focus here is sharp, the electric box next to the chair does not say ''childhood'' to me... more like ''danger''.  The pages of the book are blown, but are supposed to be what draws my eye to the chair.   I''m sorry to say  *sigh*.</td>', 'Although the focus here is sharp, the electric box next to the chair does not say ''childhood'' to me... more like ''danger''.  The pages of the book are blown, but are supposed to be what draws my eye to the chair.   I''m sorry to say  *sigh*.', '2008-01-23 09:53:51.000000', NULL, 1),
