(4417153, 634178, 86447, '<td valign="top">This is pretty... but doesn''t say ''childhood'' to me.  Also, it''s so dark that I can''t see that the horizon is straight.  The other lines are making it appear unlevel.</td>', 'This is pretty... but doesn''t say ''childhood'' to me.  Also, it''s so dark that I can''t see that the horizon is straight.  The other lines are making it appear unlevel.', '2008-01-23 10:00:04.000000', NULL, 1),
