(4418359, 635282, 88204, '<td valign="top">I love the black and white and the angle. I didn''t read you title before I looked at the image. What went through my head is, "I can remember being small and looking up some daunting climb or challenge to get to some new phsyical accomplishment... climbing the slide, crossing the monkey bars, crossing the creek, etc." I love the graduated background going from light at the bottom to a black sky... emphasizing the scary top. Very clean, very sharp, great tones... well done!</td>', 'I love the black and white and the angle. I didn''t read you title before I looked at the image. What went through my head is, "I can remember being small and looking up some daunting climb or challenge to get to some new phsyical accomplishment... climbing the slide, crossing the monkey bars, crossing the creek, etc." I love the graduated background going from light at the bottom to a black sky... emphasizing the scary top. Very clean, very sharp, great tones... well done!', '2008-01-23 16:42:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4418364, 634463, 88204, '<td valign="top">Definitely shouts childhood! Lighting is nice and even. Objects lead my eye around the frame and back to the sandwich. Nicely done although not overly exciting or eye catching.</td>', 'Definitely shouts childhood! Lighting is nice and even. Objects lead my eye around the frame and back to the sandwich. Nicely done although not overly exciting or eye catching.', '2008-01-23 16:44:39.000000', NULL, 1),
