(4418623, 637043, 68947, '<td valign="top">A little over constrasted, perhaps?  Wondering if it might be that the background was a little too busy a pattern and color to it???</td>', 'A little over constrasted, perhaps?  Wondering if it might be that the background was a little too busy a pattern and color to it???', '2008-01-23 17:50:22.000000', NULL, 1),
