(4418632, 636735, 88204, '<td valign="top">Ah yes... the dreaded objects stuck in the tree. Interesting take on the challenge. The rope is more a distraction for me. I think you could have left that out.</td>', 'Ah yes... the dreaded objects stuck in the tree. Interesting take on the challenge. The rope is more a distraction for me. I think you could have left that out.', '2008-01-23 17:52:15.000000', NULL, 1),
