(4419196, 635659, 80859, '<td valign="top">at first look, i didn''t get it, but now i do and having come from a childhood that was heavily influenced by an alcoholic father, i can''t believe i didn''t get it at first.  i think the photo seems a little out of focus, but the concept has a lot of impact and really makes you think</td>', 'at first look, i didn''t get it, but now i do and having come from a childhood that was heavily influenced by an alcoholic father, i can''t believe i didn''t get it at first.  i think the photo seems a little out of focus, but the concept has a lot of impact and really makes you think', '2008-01-23 20:47:05.000000', NULL, 1),
