(4419807, 636838, 65035, '<td valign="top">Technically you''ve managed to get that motion sickness feeling very well, thanks for that, really, I''ll be fine again soon.<br/> <br/>On a more personal level it has just struck me that we never know what the people viewing our photos bring to the experience. I look at this and I''m transported back a few years, I was taking a group of disabled kids to the park and we were putting the wheelchairs on one of these because it was the only thing they could use. I noticed a solemn little boy watching us wide eyed, after a while he disappeared to return a few moments later with his sister, in her wheelchair. We stopped the ride and helped them on but I have never forgotten the sheer joy in that boys face as he played on the playground with his sister and whole new world of possibilities opened up for him. So there you go, it brought tears to my eyes from an almost forgotten memory. We never know who a photo will touch and why.</td>', 'Technically you''ve managed to get that motion sickness feeling very well, thanks for that, really, I''ll be fine again soon. On a more personal level it has just struck me that we never know what the people viewing our photos bring to the experience. I look at this and I''m transported back a few years, I was taking a group of disabled kids to the park and we were putting the wheelchairs on one of these because it was the only thing they could use. I noticed a solemn little boy watching us wide eyed, after a while he disappeared to return a few moments later with his sister, in her wheelchair. We stopped the ride and helped them on but I have never forgotten the sheer joy in that boys face as he played on the playground with his sister and whole new world of possibilities opened up for him. So there you go, it brought tears to my eyes from an almost forgotten memory. We never know who a photo will touch and why.', '2008-01-23 23:39:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4419813, 636815, 65035, '<td valign="top">I love the processing on this, it helps make it look so forlorn.</td>', 'I love the processing on this, it helps make it look so forlorn.', '2008-01-23 23:40:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4419826, 636083, 65035, '<td valign="top">LOL yes socks are important. All Dalmatians dressed as reindeer need socks and mismatched ones are always better. The other nice thing is that this toy looks very loved.</td>', 'LOL yes socks are important. All Dalmatians dressed as reindeer need socks and mismatched ones are always better. The other nice thing is that this toy looks very loved.', '2008-01-23 23:42:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4419841, 636465, 65035, '<td valign="top">The title made me stop and think. If only there was a child? That''s sad. I prefer to think of another option, it looks like a catalogue photo that a little boy would tear out and dream over, make wishes for and keep safe under his pillow. Technically the lighting is lovely but do iron the backdrop for basic challenges.</td>', 'The title made me stop and think. If only there was a child? That''s sad. I prefer to think of another option, it looks like a catalogue photo that a little boy would tear out and dream over, make wishes for and keep safe under his pillow. Technically the lighting is lovely but do iron the backdrop for basic challenges.', '2008-01-23 23:47:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4419851, 634574, 65035, '<td valign="top">I like it, bright, fun and seen from the vantage of a child laying on the floor to use it. It looks a little small though, use the maximum size allowed for more impact.</td>', 'I like it, bright, fun and seen from the vantage of a child laying on the floor to use it. It looks a little small though, use the maximum size allowed for more impact.', '2008-01-23 23:49:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4419908, 636973, 86191, '<td valign="top">I tjat around the edges of the grass there is brown, it brings out the brown in the glove.  You did a good job positioning the glove and the ball.  The angle is good but could be better (it''s a simple ''camera straight above and shoot down at object'' shot).  The contrast is nice and not to over done.  Very nice work! =]</td>', 'I tjat around the edges of the grass there is brown, it brings out the brown in the glove.  You did a good job positioning the glove and the ball.  The angle is good but could be better (it''s a simple ''camera straight above and shoot down at object'' shot).  The contrast is nice and not to over done.  Very nice work! =]', '2008-01-24 00:04:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4419919, 637111, 88580, '<td valign="top">lol.  It''s supposed to be Childhood <i>Without</i> Children.  Well, I guess big kids don''t count...</td>', 'lol.  It''s supposed to be Childhood Without Children.  Well, I guess big kids don''t count...', '2008-01-24 00:07:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4419923, 637096, 65035, '<td valign="top">This seems a little over-saturated, or something. The front edge looks straight more than melting so the puddle looks frozen which doesn''t seen quite right with the melting ice-blocks. I love the idea though and it certainly reminds me of my childhood but for this challenge it might have said more if it were melting on concrete or a floor. That would say more about the emotion of a child dropping their ice block than a studio looking set up, for me anyway. I do like the lighting on it and the texture of the ice-blocks.</td>', 'This seems a little over-saturated, or something. The front edge looks straight more than melting so the puddle looks frozen which doesn''t seen quite right with the melting ice-blocks. I love the idea though and it certainly reminds me of my childhood but for this challenge it might have said more if it were melting on concrete or a floor. That would say more about the emotion of a child dropping their ice block than a studio looking set up, for me anyway. I do like the lighting on it and the texture of the ice-blocks.', '2008-01-24 00:08:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4419928, 636503, 86191, '<td valign="top">O.OU THAT''S A CAR!?  Wow.  I like the object and the house in the background but the image is to dark.  If I hadn''t read the title I would have been clueless on what you took a picture of.  My first reaction was "A yellow box?"   Also in my opinion, that angle should have shown more of the car. However I like the colors (the yellows are wonderful!).  Good job! :D</td>', 'O.OU THAT''S A CAR!?  Wow.  I like the object and the house in the background but the image is to dark.  If I hadn''t read the title I would have been clueless on what you took a picture of.  My first reaction was "A yellow box?"   Also in my opinion, that angle should have shown more of the car. However I like the colors (the yellows are wonderful!).  Good job! :D', '2008-01-24 00:09:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4419932, 634860, 66709, '<td valign="top">I see a child in this image</td>', 'I see a child in this image', '2008-01-24 00:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
