(4419951, 634960, 86191, '<td valign="top">Oh! I love this shot! :D  I like how the colors pop right off my screen.  What a creative idea, a teddy bear riding a horse!  It certainly defines childhood! =] The only problem I see is the red stirrup which looks over saturated and is distracting.  It takes away from the brown and rustic color theme.  But good job!  Your picture looks phenomenal! :]</td>', 'Oh! I love this shot! :D  I like how the colors pop right off my screen.  What a creative idea, a teddy bear riding a horse!  It certainly defines childhood! =] The only problem I see is the red stirrup which looks over saturated and is distracting.  It takes away from the brown and rustic color theme.  But good job!  Your picture looks phenomenal! :]', '2008-01-24 00:15:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4419960, 637030, 86191, '<td valign="top">I like how you can see the reflection of the mac and cheese in the bowl on the spoon!  The blue background really  brings out the orange and yellows!  Great job!  The only thing that bothers me is that the front part of the mac and cheese is blurry, my eyes are drawn from the spoon right down to that blurry patch.  But overall congrats on a amazing picture! :D</td>', 'I like how you can see the reflection of the mac and cheese in the bowl on the spoon!  The blue background really  brings out the orange and yellows!  Great job!  The only thing that bothers me is that the front part of the mac and cheese is blurry, my eyes are drawn from the spoon right down to that blurry patch.  But overall congrats on a amazing picture! :D', '2008-01-24 00:17:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4419966, 637037, 86191, '<td valign="top">Oh! I really like this one!  It''s always sad when swings are empty!  And the title...wow you sent shivers down my spine!  You did a good job creating contrast between the blue swings and the reddish orange bark.  However, the fact that the bark in the back of the picture are not colorful is distracting to me.  It just makes the image seem fake.  But your angle is one to be praised! :]  Great job!</td>', 'Oh! I really like this one!  It''s always sad when swings are empty!  And the title...wow you sent shivers down my spine!  You did a good job creating contrast between the blue swings and the reddish orange bark.  However, the fact that the bark in the back of the picture are not colorful is distracting to me.  It just makes the image seem fake.  But your angle is one to be praised! :]  Great job!', '2008-01-24 00:21:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4419998, 635313, 87252, '<td valign="top">Where the children played? Nice shot, the lens flare actually works really well.</td>', 'Where the children played? Nice shot, the lens flare actually works really well.', '2008-01-24 00:36:24.000000', NULL, 1),
