(4420089, 635320, 33233, '<td valign="top">The lighting is too harsh for this. Given this is a "still life" you might have been able to use low level natural light and a tripod or bounce the flash off a screen to diffuse the light.</td>', 'The lighting is too harsh for this. Given this is a "still life" you might have been able to use low level natural light and a tripod or bounce the flash off a screen to diffuse the light.', '2008-01-24 01:02:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4420092, 635320, 87252, '<td valign="top">I like the composition here, and it''s a nice idea, but the light needs sorting out. I would either have a) shot this in the late afternoon, no flash, soft natural light (also that would match the mood you''re going for here) or b) turn off the flash, put the camera on a tripod and do a long exposure.</td>', 'I like the composition here, and it''s a nice idea, but the light needs sorting out. I would either have a) shot this in the late afternoon, no flash, soft natural light (also that would match the mood you''re going for here) or b) turn off the flash, put the camera on a tripod and do a long exposure.', '2008-01-24 01:03:27.000000', NULL, 1),
