(4420274, 634178, 70689, '<td valign="top">You might have had winter sunsets in your childhood, but this picture does not express childhood to me. Furthermore, you might want to wait a little longer next time, sunsets are so much prettier after they occurred.</td>', 'You might have had winter sunsets in your childhood, but this picture does not express childhood to me. Furthermore, you might want to wait a little longer next time, sunsets are so much prettier after they occurred.', '2008-01-24 04:29:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4420275, 636320, 70689, '<td valign="top">Great pic, I like how only the face is in focus. Did you use a lensbaby for this one?</td>', 'Great pic, I like how only the face is in focus. Did you use a lensbaby for this one?', '2008-01-24 04:31:27.000000', NULL, 1),
