(4420293, 636707, 49578, '<td valign="top">A lovely perspective, good composition, BW suits it. The only bit that bothers me is highlights in the upper portion</td>', 'A lovely perspective, good composition, BW suits it. The only bit that bothers me is highlights in the upper portion', '2008-01-24 05:20:11.000000', NULL, 1),
