(4420409, 636495, 86799, '<td valign="top">I love it.  Very good idea.  It took a second to get the point, and the title was a big help.  Maybe a "little" more detail on the monster, just to bring it up.  Very cool, though.  Good work.</td>', 'I love it.  Very good idea.  It took a second to get the point, and the title was a big help.  Maybe a "little" more detail on the monster, just to bring it up.  Very cool, though.  Good work.', '2008-01-24 06:36:50.000000', NULL, 1),
