(4420620, 637108, 81382, '<td valign="top">Great lighting, lovely strong shadow but yet very soft. The objects on the stairs are a little too organised though. Would have been nice to have a bit of chaos contrasting with the clean lines of the stairs</td>', 'Great lighting, lovely strong shadow but yet very soft. The objects on the stairs are a little too organised though. Would have been nice to have a bit of chaos contrasting with the clean lines of the stairs', '2008-01-24 08:43:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4420626, 637097, 81382, '<td valign="top">Nice old fashioned look fits the title well. Not a particularly exciting viewpoint though, a ground position pointing up from the base of the climbing frame, wide angle, would have eliminated the trees just leaving you with strong contrasting structure against the sky</td>', 'Nice old fashioned look fits the title well. Not a particularly exciting viewpoint though, a ground position pointing up from the base of the climbing frame, wide angle, would have eliminated the trees just leaving you with strong contrasting structure against the sky', '2008-01-24 08:45:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4420630, 636949, 81382, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and colours, well composed. Might have been worth doing a portrait aspect ratio though to get more of the reflection in to double the interest</td>', 'Nice lighting and colours, well composed. Might have been worth doing a portrait aspect ratio though to get more of the reflection in to double the interest', '2008-01-24 08:46:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4420634, 634697, 81382, '<td valign="top">Another swing. Tones having been pushed quite hard making the entire image quite gritty, but that isn''t a bad thing here. Well composed.</td>', 'Another swing. Tones having been pushed quite hard making the entire image quite gritty, but that isn''t a bad thing here. Well composed.', '2008-01-24 08:47:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4420638, 636813, 59293, '<td valign="top">The colors are heavily saturated and overdone just waiting for the children to make it real.</td>', 'The colors are heavily saturated and overdone just waiting for the children to make it real.', '2008-01-24 08:47:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4420641, 636815, 81382, '<td valign="top">Lovely green colour cast makes this feel like I''m looking at a 20 year old print that my parents might have taken when I was little. Excellent composition, low viewpoint and DOF</td>', 'Lovely green colour cast makes this feel like I''m looking at a 20 year old print that my parents might have taken when I was little. Excellent composition, low viewpoint and DOF', '2008-01-24 08:48:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4420647, 636707, 59293, '<td valign="top">B&amp;W is a great choice.</td>', 'B&W is a great choice.', '2008-01-24 08:49:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4420650, 635996, 81382, '<td valign="top">Good shallow focus on the shoes. A wider angle might have been worth considering to add more depth as the lines have remainded fairly parallel.</td>', 'Good shallow focus on the shoes. A wider angle might have been worth considering to add more depth as the lines have remainded fairly parallel.', '2008-01-24 08:50:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4420658, 636465, 59293, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic and evocative.</td>', 'Very dramatic and evocative.', '2008-01-24 08:51:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4420663, 634451, 81382, '<td valign="top">Great concept, bit of a red colour cast of the surface although you have the white balance in the right place on the front pair of shoes. May have been worth doing a mono conversion to eliminate the colour complications. Not particularly keen on the border.</td>', 'Great concept, bit of a red colour cast of the surface although you have the white balance in the right place on the front pair of shoes. May have been worth doing a mono conversion to eliminate the colour complications. Not particularly keen on the border.', '2008-01-24 08:52:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4420670, 636433, 81382, '<td valign="top">Well lit, just the cow on its own would have been enough for me, the milk and cookies overcomplicate the image and the title IMO</td>', 'Well lit, just the cow on its own would have been enough for me, the milk and cookies overcomplicate the image and the title IMO', '2008-01-24 08:53:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4420671, 634960, 59293, '<td valign="top">Needs some top and backlight to really kick it.</td>', 'Needs some top and backlight to really kick it.', '2008-01-24 08:53:29.000000', NULL, 1),
