(4421446, 636953, 88204, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on the milk &amp; cookies idea. I don''t think the splash adds to the emotion or the feeling of childhood, but it certainly makes for a more dramatic photo. Great execution on the splash... lighting, composition, etc.</td>', 'Interesting take on the milk & cookies idea. I don''t think the splash adds to the emotion or the feeling of childhood, but it certainly makes for a more dramatic photo. Great execution on the splash... lighting, composition, etc.', '2008-01-24 12:56:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4421453, 637108, 88204, '<td valign="top">I love the natural light and the shadows caused by the posts. The repeating stairs and posts add interest. It looks unnatural for these objects to be on the staircase and for a ball to be on the skateboard, which makes the shot seemed a bit contrived.</td>', 'I love the natural light and the shadows caused by the posts. The repeating stairs and posts add interest. It looks unnatural for these objects to be on the staircase and for a ball to be on the skateboard, which makes the shot seemed a bit contrived.', '2008-01-24 12:58:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4421459, 636834, 88054, '<td valign="top">Great photo. It looks like the edges are faded out...filters? or photoshop? If post-proessing it is not allowed in "Basic Editing". Still I like it.</td>', 'Great photo. It looks like the edges are faded out...filters? or photoshop? If post-proessing it is not allowed in "Basic Editing". Still I like it.', '2008-01-24 13:00:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4421462, 636838, 88204, '<td valign="top">This brings back memories of being dizzy and stubling off. Actually, as I look at it I have a slight physical twinge of motion sickness... for real! I can''t look at the shot without getting that feeling. To me that says it''s a great shot! At first glance I thought it was an ordinary shot but I quickly realized there''s much more to it. Unfortunately I have to stop looking at it because it''s making me dizzy. You''re getting high marks from me for my strange reaction to it. 10</td>', 'This brings back memories of being dizzy and stubling off. Actually, as I look at it I have a slight physical twinge of motion sickness... for real! I can''t look at the shot without getting that feeling. To me that says it''s a great shot! At first glance I thought it was an ordinary shot but I quickly realized there''s much more to it. Unfortunately I have to stop looking at it because it''s making me dizzy. You''re getting high marks from me for my strange reaction to it. 10', '2008-01-24 13:01:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4421465, 636292, 88204, '<td valign="top">Wow... this is just plain creepy! I have to assume those are dolls and you applied some kind of negative lighting and glowing edge filters or something. Great effect!</td>', 'Wow... this is just plain creepy! I have to assume those are dolls and you applied some kind of negative lighting and glowing edge filters or something. Great effect!', '2008-01-24 13:02:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4421472, 634463, 88054, '<td valign="top">No...No...I want mine on white bread!</td>', 'No...No...I want mine on white bread!', '2008-01-24 13:03:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4421474, 637098, 88204, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on it. I''m trying to figure out what I see in the reflection on the bumper. I see your tripod and what looks like a gas station. Those obviously make it look a bit contrived but I don''t think you were trying to make it look like a real action shot.</td>', 'Interesting take on it. I''m trying to figure out what I see in the reflection on the bumper. I see your tripod and what looks like a gas station. Those obviously make it look a bit contrived but I don''t think you were trying to make it look like a real action shot.', '2008-01-24 13:04:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4421478, 634949, 55892, '<td valign="top">Great theme!  This could be improved if the toy were dirtier and positioned on it''s side, or partly buried, but then it wouldn''t be so easy to identify...</td>', 'Great theme!  This could be improved if the toy were dirtier and positioned on it''s side, or partly buried, but then it wouldn''t be so easy to identify...', '2008-01-24 13:04:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4421482, 636468, 88204, '<td valign="top">This gives me the creepy feeling of a dark figure waiting to kidnap any child who''s alone at the store. It''s sunny and bright by the car (i.e. innocence and childhood) with a dark and gloomy character in the corner. Nice shot.</td>', 'This gives me the creepy feeling of a dark figure waiting to kidnap any child who''s alone at the store. It''s sunny and bright by the car (i.e. innocence and childhood) with a dark and gloomy character in the corner. Nice shot.', '2008-01-24 13:06:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4421485, 637100, 55892, '<td valign="top">Cute!</td>', 'Cute!', '2008-01-24 13:07:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4421488, 634235, 88204, '<td valign="top">I think you could have gotten away without the book. The book seems like you''re trying to explain your image but at the same time it distracts from the real interest. The strange cat face would stand on its own.</td>', 'I think you could have gotten away without the book. The book seems like you''re trying to explain your image but at the same time it distracts from the real interest. The strange cat face would stand on its own.', '2008-01-24 13:08:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4421492, 636834, 88204, '<td valign="top">Looks like a happy place! I like the simplicity of the shot and background. The vignette works well. The lines of the fence add interest without being overpowering.</td>', 'Looks like a happy place! I like the simplicity of the shot and background. The vignette works well. The lines of the fence add interest without being overpowering.', '2008-01-24 13:09:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4421495, 637030, 88204, '<td valign="top">This IS childhood! Great color contract. Nice focus. Looks like a Kraft TV commercial. Well done!</td>', 'This IS childhood! Great color contract. Nice focus. Looks like a Kraft TV commercial. Well done!', '2008-01-24 13:09:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4421497, 636973, 88204, '<td valign="top">Great contrast. Makes it look old, like a memory. Might have been nice to move the subject off center.</td>', 'Great contrast. Makes it look old, like a memory. Might have been nice to move the subject off center.', '2008-01-24 13:10:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4421498, 635552, 55892, '<td valign="top">Worn out by love.</td>', 'Worn out by love.', '2008-01-24 13:10:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4421500, 637114, 88204, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t really evoke childhood memories for me. I think the image should be able to stand on its own without the title.</td>', 'Doesn''t really evoke childhood memories for me. I think the image should be able to stand on its own without the title.', '2008-01-24 13:11:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4421506, 636557, 55892, '<td valign="top">There were a lot of excellent black &amp; white photos in this competion, but I think this one would be better in color.  There is not enough contrast in the foreground to support the blurry background.</td>', 'There were a lot of excellent black & white photos in this competion, but I think this one would be better in color.  There is not enough contrast in the foreground to support the blurry background.', '2008-01-24 13:13:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4421514, 635630, 55892, '<td valign="top">I suppose this is a doll, but it really looks like a child.</td>', 'I suppose this is a doll, but it really looks like a child.', '2008-01-24 13:15:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4421524, 634444, 55892, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors, &amp; the background is perfect.</td>', 'Beautiful colors, & the background is perfect.', '2008-01-24 13:17:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4421538, 637096, 80859, '<td valign="top">i''m thinking two contrasting colours for the popsicles (grape &amp; orange?) might have made it stand out a little more and another background choice (like a shiny black marble surface).  the white is just overpowering for me, though it may have been ok if the popsicles were different colours.</td>', 'i''m thinking two contrasting colours for the popsicles (grape & orange?) might have made it stand out a little more and another background choice (like a shiny black marble surface).  the white is just overpowering for me, though it may have been ok if the popsicles were different colours.', '2008-01-24 13:22:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4421544, 635469, 80859, '<td valign="top">the photo is out of focus except for the blue bar in the foreground and i don''t know what the significance is.  sorry.</td>', 'the photo is out of focus except for the blue bar in the foreground and i don''t know what the significance is.  sorry.', '2008-01-24 13:23:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4421549, 635842, 80859, '<td valign="top">too out of focus for me to tell anything about it.  sorry.  i''m sure it was purposely done, but i don''t understand the significance or what i am supposed to focus on.</td>', 'too out of focus for me to tell anything about it.  sorry.  i''m sure it was purposely done, but i don''t understand the significance or what i am supposed to focus on.', '2008-01-24 13:25:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4421563, 635182, 88590, '<td valign="top">nice lighting - it could perhaps be better if more of the left shoe was in focus...</td>', 'nice lighting - it could perhaps be better if more of the left shoe was in focus...', '2008-01-24 13:29:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4421629, 637030, 88590, '<td valign="top">Love it!  I''m giving it the highest score of the challenge! Great colours, great lighting, and it''s so apropos of the challenge.  Congrats!</td>', 'Love it!  I''m giving it the highest score of the challenge! Great colours, great lighting, and it''s so apropos of the challenge.  Congrats!', '2008-01-24 13:49:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4421634, 637067, 88590, '<td valign="top">I appreciate that what you did must have been incredibly difficult - I am not sure I could ever do it.  However, I can''t get past the bricks which are blurry.</td>', 'I appreciate that what you did must have been incredibly difficult - I am not sure I could ever do it.  However, I can''t get past the bricks which are blurry.', '2008-01-24 13:51:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4421691, 634176, 75958, '<td valign="top">wish it was bigger</td>', 'wish it was bigger', '2008-01-24 14:07:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4421703, 636468, 80904, '<td valign="top">Try avoiding getting those light spots above. To avoid these purchase a lense hood and you will minimize the times this will happen</td>', 'Try avoiding getting those light spots above. To avoid these purchase a lense hood and you will minimize the times this will happen', '2008-01-24 14:12:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4421707, 634596, 80904, '<td valign="top">This shot is out of focus. you problably know that by now though</td>', 'This shot is out of focus. you problably know that by now though', '2008-01-24 14:12:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4421716, 636452, 80904, '<td valign="top">The yellow slide in the back is blown in white. Set your aperture to be smaller or your shutter to be faster.</td>', 'The yellow slide in the back is blown in white. Set your aperture to be smaller or your shutter to be faster.', '2008-01-24 14:15:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4421719, 635692, 80859, '<td valign="top">very nice composition;  b&amp;w works well here</td>', 'very nice composition;  b&w works well here', '2008-01-24 14:15:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4421722, 637006, 80859, '<td valign="top">that brings back memories.  who left that door open?  were you born in a barn? lol</td>', 'that brings back memories.  who left that door open?  were you born in a barn? lol', '2008-01-24 14:16:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4421728, 637100, 80859, '<td valign="top">very cool perpective.  i like the idea and the concept is unique compared to the other teddy bears in the challenge.</td>', 'very cool perpective.  i like the idea and the concept is unique compared to the other teddy bears in the challenge.', '2008-01-24 14:17:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4421729, 634081, 80859, '<td valign="top">i like the title and the adult hand reaching for her</td>', 'i like the title and the adult hand reaching for her', '2008-01-24 14:18:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4421752, 636735, 18552, '<td valign="top">I think your picture might have been more effective if you had shown more of the swing and just forgotten the shoes.</td>', 'I think your picture might have been more effective if you had shown more of the swing and just forgotten the shoes.', '2008-01-24 14:24:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4421783, 636849, 80859, '<td valign="top">this was one of the more unique ideas of the challenge.  composition is good and b&amp;w was good choice.</td>', 'this was one of the more unique ideas of the challenge.  composition is good and b&w was good choice.', '2008-01-24 14:35:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4421862, 636495, 73115, '<td valign="top">Great idea and execution! I think it would be even better if the boogie man were more in the shadows or more of a shadow.</td>', 'Great idea and execution! I think it would be even better if the boogie man were more in the shadows or more of a shadow.', '2008-01-24 15:07:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4421890, 637100, 43774, '<td valign="top">Oh this is so cute. Love the perspective, it''s like I am a child standing in the back garden waiting for him to dry. Actually reminds me of my niece when she was 2 (she is now 16). Her mother washed her "blankie" and hung it on the line to dry. My niece sat on the ground under the clothes line and cried for her blankie. Excuse me for rambling. :)</td>', 'Oh this is so cute. Love the perspective, it''s like I am a child standing in the back garden waiting for him to dry. Actually reminds me of my niece when she was 2 (she is now 16). Her mother washed her "blankie" and hung it on the line to dry. My niece sat on the ground under the clothes line and cried for her blankie. Excuse me for rambling. :)', '2008-01-24 15:14:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4421893, 636838, 43774, '<td valign="top">Fun photo, love the motion!</td>', 'Fun photo, love the motion!', '2008-01-24 15:15:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4421895, 637030, 43774, '<td valign="top">I must have been the only child not to like that stuff. My mother would make it for my brother and sister and I would have something else. Wonderful colours and comp here.</td>', 'I must have been the only child not to like that stuff. My mother would make it for my brother and sister and I would have something else. Wonderful colours and comp here.', '2008-01-24 15:15:48.000000', NULL, 1);
