(4424481, 634596, 71526, '<td valign="top">The bucket is a bit blurry/out of focus. Sometimes some cameras have problems focusing on reflecting objects... you need to focus manually or focusing on an object at the same distance (to the bucket in this case).<br/>After writing the above i''ve seen your EXIF... Exposed Time = 1/8 seconds, did you used tripod? If not this exaplains the blurry image.<br/>Gave you a 5.</td>', 'The bucket is a bit blurry/out of focus. Sometimes some cameras have problems focusing on reflecting objects... you need to focus manually or focusing on an object at the same distance (to the bucket in this case).After writing the above i''ve seen your EXIF... Exposed Time = 1/8 seconds, did you used tripod? If not this exaplains the blurry image.Gave you a 5.', '2008-01-25 13:35:59.000000', NULL, 1),
