(4425515, 636969, 24974, '<td valign="top">I don''t know that the title fits the shot. If it were laying on it''s side, perhaps. Nice shot, though.</td>', 'I don''t know that the title fits the shot. If it were laying on it''s side, perhaps. Nice shot, though.', '2008-01-25 22:35:47.000000', NULL, 1),
