(4425522, 636953, 24974, '<td valign="top">Wow, what a mess that must''ve made. How much milk and how many clean-ups between shots did this take, anyway?!?</td>', 'Wow, what a mess that must''ve made. How much milk and how many clean-ups between shots did this take, anyway?!?', '2008-01-25 22:38:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4425529, 636082, 24974, '<td valign="top">Cutte shot. I wish the picture looked more like it was actually draw by a child. At least, a child of teddy-bear age.</td>', 'Cutte shot. I wish the picture looked more like it was actually draw by a child. At least, a child of teddy-bear age.', '2008-01-25 22:40:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4425533, 636849, 24974, '<td valign="top">Love it! Very clever title! And AT&amp;T claims they have the fewest dropped calls of any network!  ;-)  9</td>', 'Love it! Very clever title! And AT&T claims they have the fewest dropped calls of any network!  ;-)  9', '2008-01-25 22:42:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4425534, 635218, 24974, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective. Well shot. 9</td>', 'Nice perspective. Well shot. 9', '2008-01-25 22:42:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4425535, 636307, 87808, '<td valign="top">I do not get the connection, and the poop coming out has totally distracted me now.  Edited for crap spelling</td>', 'I do not get the connection, and the poop coming out has totally distracted me now.  Edited for crap spelling', '2008-01-25 22:42:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4425536, 635282, 24974, '<td valign="top">Very cool perspective. It really captures the feel of a monumental climb. Love it. 9</td>', 'Very cool perspective. It really captures the feel of a monumental climb. Love it. 9', '2008-01-25 22:43:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4425538, 634451, 24974, '<td valign="top">My youngest daughter has that exact pair of shoes (front ones). Now I''m depressed. Thanks.  ;-)  I love the concept. 8</td>', 'My youngest daughter has that exact pair of shoes (front ones). Now I''m depressed. Thanks.  ;-)  I love the concept. 8', '2008-01-25 22:44:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4425541, 637100, 24974, '<td valign="top">Shouldn''t that be "dwy"?  ;-)  Cute shot. 8</td>', 'Shouldn''t that be "dwy"?  ;-)  Cute shot. 8', '2008-01-25 22:45:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4425777, 634596, 69246, '<td valign="top">Out of focus.</td>', 'Out of focus.', '2008-01-26 01:10:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4425780, 637117, 69246, '<td valign="top">This photo has a lot of feeling to it. I can smell the ozone in the air, and feel the humidity....Very nicely done!</td>', 'This photo has a lot of feeling to it. I can smell the ozone in the air, and feel the humidity....Very nicely done!', '2008-01-26 01:11:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4425781, 636842, 69246, '<td valign="top">The yellow color cast takes a lot away from this photo, as does the very low depth of field.</td>', 'The yellow color cast takes a lot away from this photo, as does the very low depth of field.', '2008-01-26 01:12:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4425787, 635842, 69246, '<td valign="top">Way too out of focus....</td>', 'Way too out of focus....', '2008-01-26 01:21:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4425789, 635957, 69246, '<td valign="top">Excellent!!!</td>', 'Excellent!!!', '2008-01-26 01:21:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4425791, 634398, 69246, '<td valign="top">The angle is quite distracting.</td>', 'The angle is quite distracting.', '2008-01-26 01:22:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4425792, 636838, 69246, '<td valign="top">Very good perspective.</td>', 'Very good perspective.', '2008-01-26 01:22:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4425793, 636604, 69246, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.</td>', 'Nicely done.', '2008-01-26 01:23:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4425798, 636790, 69246, '<td valign="top">I like this. It brings me back to the time I spent in Japan. Best 3 months ever!! I remember the children walking to school. Points given for hitting a personal note.</td>', 'I like this. It brings me back to the time I spent in Japan. Best 3 months ever!! I remember the children walking to school. Points given for hitting a personal note.', '2008-01-26 01:24:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4425803, 636292, 69246, '<td valign="top">The use of the negative just doesn''t work here.</td>', 'The use of the negative just doesn''t work here.', '2008-01-26 01:26:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4425810, 636960, 69246, '<td valign="top">You no doubt moved the zoom ring...I love it.</td>', 'You no doubt moved the zoom ring...I love it.', '2008-01-26 01:28:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4425820, 635182, 69246, '<td valign="top">I think a greater depth of field would have helped this more, especially with the title. Seeing the transition from the pacifier, pooh bear, and shoes would have been more striking for me.</td>', 'I think a greater depth of field would have helped this more, especially with the title. Seeing the transition from the pacifier, pooh bear, and shoes would have been more striking for me.', '2008-01-26 01:30:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4425825, 636826, 69246, '<td valign="top">Too much grain and a bit out of focus.</td>', 'Too much grain and a bit out of focus.', '2008-01-26 01:32:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4425840, 634759, 69246, '<td valign="top">While I''m not too fond of the color cast, I love the emotion this brings. Points given for a decent photo and fully meeting the challenge.</td>', 'While I''m not too fond of the color cast, I love the emotion this brings. Points given for a decent photo and fully meeting the challenge.', '2008-01-26 01:38:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4425844, 636898, 69246, '<td valign="top">Well done!</td>', 'Well done!', '2008-01-26 01:40:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4425872, 634596, 84779, '<td valign="top">to out of focous</td>', 'to out of focous', '2008-01-26 01:56:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4425873, 636982, 84779, '<td valign="top">such a permagrin</td>', 'such a permagrin', '2008-01-26 02:06:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4425887, 636465, 54645, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Negative space works, and I like the reflection in the foreground 7</td>', 'Nice shot. Negative space works, and I like the reflection in the foreground 7', '2008-01-26 03:00:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4425889, 636865, 54645, '<td valign="top">Reflection of your childhood?!</td>', 'Reflection of your childhood?!', '2008-01-26 03:00:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4425890, 637100, 54645, '<td valign="top">classic. nice shot</td>', 'classic. nice shot', '2008-01-26 03:00:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4425891, 636890, 54645, '<td valign="top">A little flat. Would benefit from color sat/contrast. I like the composition</td>', 'A little flat. Would benefit from color sat/contrast. I like the composition', '2008-01-26 03:01:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4425949, 637043, 81382, '<td valign="top">Crazy background - does rather take away from the toys which are so well lit. A neutral background would keep it much simpler and would be more effective IMO</td>', 'Crazy background - does rather take away from the toys which are so well lit. A neutral background would keep it much simpler and would be more effective IMO', '2008-01-26 06:27:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4425950, 634398, 81382, '<td valign="top">Quite dull tones, B&amp;W always benefit from slightly clipped shadows and highlights to increase contrast and impact. A visit to the curves or levels shop during popst processing would have brought this to life</td>', 'Quite dull tones, B&W always benefit from slightly clipped shadows and highlights to increase contrast and impact. A visit to the curves or levels shop during popst processing would have brought this to life', '2008-01-26 06:28:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4425951, 634941, 81382, '<td valign="top">To me, the singular ball is the subject and would be better in focus with maybe just one or two jacks in focus too and the rest thrown into the blur</td>', 'To me, the singular ball is the subject and would be better in focus with maybe just one or two jacks in focus too and the rest thrown into the blur', '2008-01-26 06:30:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4425952, 634294, 81382, '<td valign="top">Clearly not an original idea as quite a few other entries are similar. Good B&amp;W conversation though. Maybe getting in close to one of the swings and increasing the appature size to thrown some the distant ad very close ones out of focus might have given more depth.</td>', 'Clearly not an original idea as quite a few other entries are similar. Good B&W conversation though. Maybe getting in close to one of the swings and increasing the appature size to thrown some the distant ad very close ones out of focus might have given more depth.', '2008-01-26 06:32:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4425955, 635750, 81382, '<td valign="top">Another swing - except here the focus seems to be on the ground and not on the swing which is a shame. Maybe the swing is just suffering from a bit of motion blur, in which case it might have been worth exaggerating the effect with a longer exposure to make it clear to the viewer that this was your intention.</td>', 'Another swing - except here the focus seems to be on the ground and not on the swing which is a shame. Maybe the swing is just suffering from a bit of motion blur, in which case it might have been worth exaggerating the effect with a longer exposure to make it clear to the viewer that this was your intention.', '2008-01-26 06:34:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4425956, 636600, 81382, '<td valign="top">Lovely lighting, nice and simple. Might have been worth balancing out the colour saturation by bringing up the blues and greens to the same level as the red and yellow.</td>', 'Lovely lighting, nice and simple. Might have been worth balancing out the colour saturation by bringing up the blues and greens to the same level as the red and yellow.', '2008-01-26 06:35:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4426139, 636876, 54645, '<td valign="top">I''ve enjoyed this shot. Although I think improved focus or more depth of field would have helped this shot. I like the composition with the swings leading my eye to the house.</td>', 'I''ve enjoyed this shot. Although I think improved focus or more depth of field would have helped this shot. I like the composition with the swings leading my eye to the house.', '2008-01-26 10:22:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4426142, 635119, 54645, '<td valign="top">Nice comp. Appears over sharpened given the appearance of dots on backlit hairs and whiskers. This shot evoked a great response from my kids! Good job.</td>', 'Nice comp. Appears over sharpened given the appearance of dots on backlit hairs and whiskers. This shot evoked a great response from my kids! Good job.', '2008-01-26 10:24:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4426143, 636973, 54645, '<td valign="top">Nice center comp.</td>', 'Nice center comp.', '2008-01-26 10:24:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4426202, 634960, 89465, '<td valign="top">Good color and contrast</td>', 'Good color and contrast', '2008-01-26 10:48:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4426259, 637023, 29513, '<td valign="top">I like the colors.  A different take on the abandoned playground.  Nice.</td>', 'I like the colors.  A different take on the abandoned playground.  Nice.', '2008-01-26 11:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
