(4429057, 636838, 77196, '<td valign="top">Where did you find this death trap? Tear it out! It isn''t safe! (But boy was it fun!!!) Nice shot - blurred background, the well used and polished metal bare of all traces of paint. I''m guessing you were riding it when you took the shot. Do you remember the ones that had seats around the outside edge, and no floor in the center - just open bars that kids would stand on? I remember getting whacked a couple of times on those. Your shot makes me smile.</td>', 'Where did you find this death trap? Tear it out! It isn''t safe! (But boy was it fun!!!) Nice shot - blurred background, the well used and polished metal bare of all traces of paint. I''m guessing you were riding it when you took the shot. Do you remember the ones that had seats around the outside edge, and no floor in the center - just open bars that kids would stand on? I remember getting whacked a couple of times on those. Your shot makes me smile.', '2008-01-27 14:07:40.000000', NULL, 1),
