(4432531, 636609, 67258, '<td valign="top">Not at all keen on the idea of children and guns, and for that reason I have saved this for last and come back to it time and again.  It is a superb composition - almost bucolic in its presentation.  The depth of field is, to my eyes, spot on.  So, despite being made slightly uncomfortable by the image, a 9 from me, and the highest mark I have given in this challenge.</td>', 'Not at all keen on the idea of children and guns, and for that reason I have saved this for last and come back to it time and again.  It is a superb composition - almost bucolic in its presentation.  The depth of field is, to my eyes, spot on.  So, despite being made slightly uncomfortable by the image, a 9 from me, and the highest mark I have given in this challenge.', '2008-01-28 11:31:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4432542, 636890, 89431, '<td valign="top">I like the different scence for the jungle gym and the colors on it contrast really well with the dull beach colors.</td>', 'I like the different scence for the jungle gym and the colors on it contrast really well with the dull beach colors.', '2008-01-28 11:33:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4432607, 637030, 89431, '<td valign="top">This screams childhood! The detail is sharp and the blue background contrasts nicely with the orange/ yellow noodles. I would be careful about getting too close to your subject, the bottom part of your picture got a little blurry and didn''t match up with the sharpness of the top of the photo.</td>', 'This screams childhood! The detail is sharp and the blue background contrasts nicely with the orange/ yellow noodles. I would be careful about getting too close to your subject, the bottom part of your picture got a little blurry and didn''t match up with the sharpness of the top of the photo.', '2008-01-28 11:43:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4432623, 635830, 89431, '<td valign="top">I like the close up, abstract point of view. It shows you really thought about the challege with the spilled milk, we all know kids are messy. I also love the smoothness of the milk up against the rough looking texture on the cookie. Outstanding job!</td>', 'I like the close up, abstract point of view. It shows you really thought about the challege with the spilled milk, we all know kids are messy. I also love the smoothness of the milk up against the rough looking texture on the cookie. Outstanding job!', '2008-01-28 11:46:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4432634, 635630, 89431, '<td valign="top">This confuses me, I had to look at your title to even understand how this related to the challenge. The idea was good but I think you missed the mark by using the model. I do however love your choice of vibrant colors, that to me is the only thing child-like in this photograph.</td>', 'This confuses me, I had to look at your title to even understand how this related to the challenge. The idea was good but I think you missed the mark by using the model. I do however love your choice of vibrant colors, that to me is the only thing child-like in this photograph.', '2008-01-28 11:49:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4432654, 636743, 89431, '<td valign="top">This is a good picture but it almost looks too neat to belong to a kid. I like how the colors are consistently repeated in slightly different hues, as is the circle shape in the cup, jars, and plate. Leaving the crusts on the plate was a nice touch!</td>', 'This is a good picture but it almost looks too neat to belong to a kid. I like how the colors are consistently repeated in slightly different hues, as is the circle shape in the cup, jars, and plate. Leaving the crusts on the plate was a nice touch!', '2008-01-28 11:53:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4432689, 635957, 89431, '<td valign="top">I love your concept and I think you really got your point across, I feel like you went to my own elementary school classroom. It is very busy picture but my eye immedietly followed the line of the desks to the window with the playground. The business doesn''t bother me though, it''s fun to look around and see new things. The bit of color in the corner is distracting, and overall gives off a sad depressing mood of being "rapped in the classroom while the playground taunts you."</td>', 'I love your concept and I think you really got your point across, I feel like you went to my own elementary school classroom. It is very busy picture but my eye immedietly followed the line of the desks to the window with the playground. The business doesn''t bother me though, it''s fun to look around and see new things. The bit of color in the corner is distracting, and overall gives off a sad depressing mood of being "rapped in the classroom while the playground taunts you."', '2008-01-28 12:03:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4432712, 634444, 70503, '<td valign="top">LOVE THIS!!! Bright colors and great lighting!!</td>', 'LOVE THIS!!! Bright colors and great lighting!!', '2008-01-28 12:16:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4432716, 635282, 70503, '<td valign="top">The perspective is awesome and the black and white just "MAKES" it! I feel like a kid looking up at it. Nicely done!!</td>', 'The perspective is awesome and the black and white just "MAKES" it! I feel like a kid looking up at it. Nicely done!!', '2008-01-28 12:17:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4432723, 636837, 70503, '<td valign="top">I love the lighting! Makes me want to POP them :o)</td>', 'I love the lighting! Makes me want to POP them :o)', '2008-01-28 12:19:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4432729, 636451, 70503, '<td valign="top">This is too cool! I love the bounce shaddow under the green ball. The colors are so vibrant.</td>', 'This is too cool! I love the bounce shaddow under the green ball. The colors are so vibrant.', '2008-01-28 12:20:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4432734, 636973, 70503, '<td valign="top">I can almost smell the grass and the leather glove. Nice shot!</td>', 'I can almost smell the grass and the leather glove. Nice shot!', '2008-01-28 12:22:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4432735, 636877, 70503, '<td valign="top">Too Cute!</td>', 'Too Cute!', '2008-01-28 12:22:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4432736, 637098, 70503, '<td valign="top">HAHAHA!!!</td>', 'HAHAHA!!!', '2008-01-28 12:22:27.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4432740, 635345, 70503, '<td valign="top">Nice focus on the dice. It makes me want to play!</td>', 'Nice focus on the dice. It makes me want to play!', '2008-01-28 12:23:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4432744, 637117, 70503, '<td valign="top">Love the sky. I think I would have liked color better.</td>', 'Love the sky. I think I would have liked color better.', '2008-01-28 12:26:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4432782, 636518, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, but The DOF is was off. The way the entire right 2/3 of the shot is out of focus does it in, I''m afraid.</td>', 'I like the idea, but The DOF is was off. The way the entire right 2/3 of the shot is out of focus does it in, I''m afraid.', '2008-01-28 12:36:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4432793, 634294, 88656, '<td valign="top">I love how your picture is black and white</td>', 'I love how your picture is black and white', '2008-01-28 12:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4432795, 636849, 83313, '<td valign="top">Isn''t that just like technology, to fail when you need it most? I love the idea here, but the image is good, though not wowing me.</td>', 'Isn''t that just like technology, to fail when you need it most? I love the idea here, but the image is good, though not wowing me.', '2008-01-28 12:39:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4432802, 636949, 83313, '<td valign="top">Great lighting. The pony looks a little spooky. Got an evil Barney shot? Maybe a little too much empty space on te right for me.</td>', 'Great lighting. The pony looks a little spooky. Got an evil Barney shot? Maybe a little too much empty space on te right for me.', '2008-01-28 12:40:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4432806, 635469, 88656, '<td valign="top">I LOVE THIS! There are so many things i like i''m not gunna mention them all but i especially like the color in your photo and the water on the playground! Amazing!</td>', 'I LOVE THIS! There are so many things i like i''m not gunna mention them all but i especially like the color in your photo and the water on the playground! Amazing!', '2008-01-28 12:41:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4432809, 637083, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. The reflections on the floor grab my eye.</td>', 'Nicely done. The reflections on the floor grab my eye.', '2008-01-28 12:42:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4432813, 634697, 88656, '<td valign="top">I really like this picture! I love how it''s in black and white but it is kind of hard to see the swing. It blends into the trees a little to much but other wise i really like it! Good Job!</td>', 'I really like this picture! I love how it''s in black and white but it is kind of hard to see the swing. It blends into the trees a little to much but other wise i really like it! Good Job!', '2008-01-28 12:43:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4432816, 637023, 83313, '<td valign="top">Looks serioulsy overenhanced to bring out the image in a dark shot. At first I thought this was toys on a tabletop.</td>', 'Looks serioulsy overenhanced to bring out the image in a dark shot. At first I thought this was toys on a tabletop.', '2008-01-28 12:44:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4432819, 636921, 88656, '<td valign="top">Really cool! :)</td>', 'Really cool! :)', '2008-01-28 12:45:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4432823, 636921, 83313, '<td valign="top">This shot and the title suggests to me that the child has grown up and left. I like the mood and the yellow-orange cast.</td>', 'This shot and the title suggests to me that the child has grown up and left. I like the mood and the yellow-orange cast.', '2008-01-28 12:45:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4432834, 635552, 83313, '<td valign="top">Decent comp, good detail and lighting. It''s not wowing me, but I don''t know why. Maybe the loud box is fighting with the bears as the subject for my attention.</td>', 'Decent comp, good detail and lighting. It''s not wowing me, but I don''t know why. Maybe the loud box is fighting with the bears as the subject for my attention.', '2008-01-28 12:48:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4432848, 636465, 83313, '<td valign="top">Good lighting and colors, the image is nice and clean, but it seems a little too still and centered up. Maybe a perspective from another angle might help.</td>', 'Good lighting and colors, the image is nice and clean, but it seems a little too still and centered up. Maybe a perspective from another angle might help.', '2008-01-28 12:50:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4432858, 636971, 83313, '<td valign="top">Sees a little busy for the sepia. Nothing stands out to me. I can see some good effort though.</td>', 'Sees a little busy for the sepia. Nothing stands out to me. I can see some good effort though.', '2008-01-28 12:52:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4432865, 634860, 83313, '<td valign="top">Gotta love the attitude in this one!</td>', 'Gotta love the attitude in this one!', '2008-01-28 12:52:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4432869, 634941, 83313, '<td valign="top">My eye goes toward the ball, but the focus is on the jacks in the foreground.</td>', 'My eye goes toward the ball, but the focus is on the jacks in the foreground.', '2008-01-28 12:54:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4432882, 637075, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like the texture and appearance of the part that is in focus, but the depth of field should be much better for a scene like this. It also seems cropped too closely, especially at the top.</td>', 'I like the texture and appearance of the part that is in focus, but the depth of field should be much better for a scene like this. It also seems cropped too closely, especially at the top.', '2008-01-28 12:56:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4432892, 637031, 83313, '<td valign="top">Similar to at least one other entry, but I like this one much better. Colors could use a little bumping up, Those slides are normally a bright yellow. That low contrast may have been intentional, however.</td>', 'Similar to at least one other entry, but I like this one much better. Colors could use a little bumping up, Those slides are normally a bright yellow. That low contrast may have been intentional, however.', '2008-01-28 12:59:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4432900, 635830, 83313, '<td valign="top">Thanks, now I''m hungry for something chocolate!</td>', 'Thanks, now I''m hungry for something chocolate!', '2008-01-28 13:00:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4432929, 634463, 83313, '<td valign="top">A peanut butter and M&amp;M sammich. Yum!! Not sure if the composition totally works for me, but I like the concept and the use of the M&amp;M''s to add some punch.<br/> <br/>I looked at your file size and I think part of the problem is too much JPEG compression is killing the details. Your file size is less than half what you could have used. Always used the lowest level of compression (resulting in the largest file) that will sneak in under the limit for a challenge. (150K in this case)</td>', 'A peanut butter and M&M sammich. Yum!! Not sure if the composition totally works for me, but I like the concept and the use of the M&M''s to add some punch. I looked at your file size and I think part of the problem is too much JPEG compression is killing the details. Your file size is less than half what you could have used. Always used the lowest level of compression (resulting in the largest file) that will sneak in under the limit for a challenge. (150K in this case)', '2008-01-28 13:06:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4432938, 634178, 83313, '<td valign="top">I don''t see anything here that specifically says "childhood". I like the sunbeams appearance, but it''s not an outstanding sunset shot otherwise.</td>', 'I don''t see anything here that specifically says "childhood". I like the sunbeams appearance, but it''s not an outstanding sunset shot otherwise.', '2008-01-28 13:08:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4432952, 634288, 83313, '<td valign="top">Good, though a little too dark, and I''m viewing it on a fairly new and calibrated monitor right now.<br/> <br/>A huge part of the problem here is that too much JPEG compression is killing the details. Your file size is only 22k, and you could have used up to 150k in this challenge. Always used the lowest level of compression (resulting in the largest file and greatest detail) that will sneak in under the limit for a challenge.</td>', 'Good, though a little too dark, and I''m viewing it on a fairly new and calibrated monitor right now. A huge part of the problem here is that too much JPEG compression is killing the details. Your file size is only 22k, and you could have used up to 150k in this challenge. Always used the lowest level of compression (resulting in the largest file and greatest detail) that will sneak in under the limit for a challenge.', '2008-01-28 13:12:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4432956, 634960, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like the image, though the crop seems a little too tight.</td>', 'I like the image, though the crop seems a little too tight.', '2008-01-28 13:13:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4432963, 636604, 83313, '<td valign="top">Awwww, he''s having to play alone! I like it. Good lighting and comp. It works.</td>', 'Awwww, he''s having to play alone! I like it. Good lighting and comp. It works.', '2008-01-28 13:14:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4432971, 637079, 83313, '<td valign="top">Seems like a casual snapshot, i''m afraid.</td>', 'Seems like a casual snapshot, i''m afraid.', '2008-01-28 13:15:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4432979, 635182, 83313, '<td valign="top">DOF is not that great on the left side. Otherwise this would have been a really good shot.</td>', 'DOF is not that great on the left side. Otherwise this would have been a really good shot.', '2008-01-28 13:16:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4432988, 635469, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice and bold, both the image itself and the concept in the title.</td>', 'Nice and bold, both the image itself and the concept in the title.', '2008-01-28 13:17:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4432998, 636609, 83313, '<td valign="top">I''m not a gun person, so I did not immediately recognize this as a bb gun. Almost cried "DNMC". I like the way the woodtones appear in this. Rich and textured.</td>', 'I''m not a gun person, so I did not immediately recognize this as a bb gun. Almost cried "DNMC". I like the way the woodtones appear in this. Rich and textured.', '2008-01-28 13:20:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4433006, 635659, 83313, '<td valign="top">What a message this delivers. Probably won''t ribbon, but certainly deserves some other recognition for effective delivery of a strong message.</td>', 'What a message this delivers. Probably won''t ribbon, but certainly deserves some other recognition for effective delivery of a strong message.', '2008-01-28 13:21:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4433013, 635218, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice use of monochrome. Not sure about the sepia, though. It''s still one of my faves in this challenge so far. (But I am biased to bicycle pictures)</td>', 'Nice use of monochrome. Not sure about the sepia, though. It''s still one of my faves in this challenge so far. (But I am biased to bicycle pictures)', '2008-01-28 13:23:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4433024, 635842, 83313, '<td valign="top">Tons of JPEG compression kills an otherwise dreamlike and good shot. The artifacts are so bad that I didn''t even need to look at the file size to tell. I looked to be sure though, and at 31k, saving it with a lot less compression would have vastly improved it.<br/> <br/>Always used the lowest level of compression (resulting in the largest file and greatest detail) that will sneak in under the limit for a challenge.</td>', 'Tons of JPEG compression kills an otherwise dreamlike and good shot. The artifacts are so bad that I didn''t even need to look at the file size to tell. I looked to be sure though, and at 31k, saving it with a lot less compression would have vastly improved it. Always used the lowest level of compression (resulting in the largest file and greatest detail) that will sneak in under the limit for a challenge.', '2008-01-28 13:26:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4433038, 636813, 83313, '<td valign="top">That Barbie has it all! Men want her, women envy her...<br/> <br/>Lighting seems a little hard, but I''m not sure how to tell you to do it differently.</td>', 'That Barbie has it all! Men want her, women envy her... Lighting seems a little hard, but I''m not sure how to tell you to do it differently.', '2008-01-28 13:29:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4433041, 635345, 83313, '<td valign="top">Just ehough detail to see it''s a monoploy board. My eye makes a beeline right for the dice. I like this one.</td>', 'Just ehough detail to see it''s a monoploy board. My eye makes a beeline right for the dice. I like this one.', '2008-01-28 13:30:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4433099, 636082, 33446, '<td valign="top">The universal house of a childhood drawing!!!!</td>', 'The universal house of a childhood drawing!!!!', '2008-01-28 13:46:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4433109, 634288, 33446, '<td valign="top">A beautiful subtle statement.</td>', 'A beautiful subtle statement.', '2008-01-28 13:48:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4433110, 634897, 22970, '<td valign="top">Not a bad shot but looks like a snap shot. I think you took your photograph in the mid-zone meaning a closer view of an element of the playground would of worked better or further back giving showing the complete playground. The lighting does not stand out but the focus is ok. <br/> <br/>I wish you the best in the challenge and hope you find this comment constructive.</td>', 'Not a bad shot but looks like a snap shot. I think you took your photograph in the mid-zone meaning a closer view of an element of the playground would of worked better or further back giving showing the complete playground. The lighting does not stand out but the focus is ok.  I wish you the best in the challenge and hope you find this comment constructive.', '2008-01-28 13:48:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4433119, 634596, 33446, '<td valign="top">Ah, this would have been perfect without the slight blurr.</td>', 'Ah, this would have been perfect without the slight blurr.', '2008-01-28 13:50:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4433122, 636825, 33446, '<td valign="top">What a great concept in appropriate lighting.</td>', 'What a great concept in appropriate lighting.', '2008-01-28 13:51:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4433169, 637096, 33446, '<td valign="top">Over-saturated?</td>', 'Over-saturated?', '2008-01-28 14:00:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4433177, 634235, 33446, '<td valign="top">sure do!!!</td>', 'sure do!!!', '2008-01-28 14:01:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4433238, 634451, 76908, '<td valign="top">Very original, I like this!</td>', 'Very original, I like this!', '2008-01-28 14:07:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4433268, 634288, 76908, '<td valign="top">I really like this, would be amazing with a little bit more light.</td>', 'I really like this, would be amazing with a little bit more light.', '2008-01-28 14:11:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4433284, 636921, 87670, '<td valign="top">I really like the idea of this photograph, beautiful job. The swing is a little dark for me but the overall feel of the picture is captivating. Nice job.</td>', 'I really like the idea of this photograph, beautiful job. The swing is a little dark for me but the overall feel of the picture is captivating. Nice job.', '2008-01-28 14:14:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4433405, 636452, 74953, '<td valign="top">The colors look a little washed out, but could be from sun fade too.</td>', 'The colors look a little washed out, but could be from sun fade too.', '2008-01-28 14:38:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4433410, 635314, 74953, '<td valign="top">Image not in focus and the shed is a bit distracting.</td>', 'Image not in focus and the shed is a bit distracting.', '2008-01-28 14:39:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4433415, 636838, 74953, '<td valign="top">Nice creative "spin" on the challenge.</td>', 'Nice creative "spin" on the challenge.', '2008-01-28 14:40:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4433444, 636953, 74953, '<td valign="top">I like the attempt, but the image appears noisy....unless there is some finish that is on the table.</td>', 'I like the attempt, but the image appears noisy....unless there is some finish that is on the table.', '2008-01-28 14:47:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4433451, 634382, 74953, '<td valign="top">The teddy bear has seen better days.</td>', 'The teddy bear has seen better days.', '2008-01-28 14:48:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4433456, 637043, 74953, '<td valign="top">The background is a bit overpowering.</td>', 'The background is a bit overpowering.', '2008-01-28 14:49:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4433460, 636616, 74953, '<td valign="top">Really nice concept for this challenge.  Well done.</td>', 'Really nice concept for this challenge.  Well done.', '2008-01-28 14:49:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4433538, 635843, 69102, '<td valign="top">nice take on the challenge. background works against the main subject for me.</td>', 'nice take on the challenge. background works against the main subject for me.', '2008-01-28 15:03:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4433551, 635495, 69102, '<td valign="top">nice idea and great use of shallow DOF. white balance seems a little off to me. might try to set the white point off the toy trucks ladder and see if that makes the colors pop a little more and brings out a little more contrast.</td>', 'nice idea and great use of shallow DOF. white balance seems a little off to me. might try to set the white point off the toy trucks ladder and see if that makes the colors pop a little more and brings out a little more contrast.', '2008-01-28 15:05:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4433552, 636921, 69102, '<td valign="top">nice perspective and great sky - 6</td>', 'nice perspective and great sky - 6', '2008-01-28 15:05:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4433561, 637097, 69102, '<td valign="top">the photo comes across very flat, with little contrast and no central point of interest. the trees in the background and the equipment are all tangled up together visually.</td>', 'the photo comes across very flat, with little contrast and no central point of interest. the trees in the background and the equipment are all tangled up together visually.', '2008-01-28 15:06:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4433569, 635750, 69102, '<td valign="top">nice shot - like that the angle of the swing echoes the support pole (although might have been better without the pole at all). house in the background adds visual interest.</td>', 'nice shot - like that the angle of the swing echoes the support pole (although might have been better without the pole at all). house in the background adds visual interest.', '2008-01-28 15:07:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4433576, 635996, 69102, '<td valign="top">nicely done - good color conversion and excellent DOF - 7.</td>', 'nicely done - good color conversion and excellent DOF - 7.', '2008-01-28 15:08:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4433586, 635957, 69102, '<td valign="top">very nice - like the low color saturation here, works very well to evoke the mood.</td>', 'very nice - like the low color saturation here, works very well to evoke the mood.', '2008-01-28 15:09:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4433605, 635314, 69102, '<td valign="top">i think you''re trying to convey a sense of childhood emotion or abandon here, but it just doesn''t work for me. primarily this is because the background is in sharp focus and the figure is blurred from the motion - the attention falls away from her to the background, which is too cluttered and visually uninteresting.</td>', 'i think you''re trying to convey a sense of childhood emotion or abandon here, but it just doesn''t work for me. primarily this is because the background is in sharp focus and the figure is blurred from the motion - the attention falls away from her to the background, which is too cluttered and visually uninteresting.', '2008-01-28 15:12:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4433612, 635063, 69102, '<td valign="top">subject is good, but the black and white conversion here comes across very flat. needs more contrast.</td>', 'subject is good, but the black and white conversion here comes across very flat. needs more contrast.', '2008-01-28 15:13:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4433625, 634558, 69102, '<td valign="top">not bad - would like a little more room around the bottom edge of the swing so that it doesn''t appear cut off by the frame</td>', 'not bad - would like a little more room around the bottom edge of the swing so that it doesn''t appear cut off by the frame', '2008-01-28 15:15:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4433639, 635659, 69102, '<td valign="top">very disturbing - doesn''t evoke the idea of "childhood" at all to me as the doll evokes an adult woman, rather than a child</td>', 'very disturbing - doesn''t evoke the idea of "childhood" at all to me as the doll evokes an adult woman, rather than a child', '2008-01-28 15:16:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4433648, 634178, 69102, '<td valign="top">nice sunset, but nothing about this specifically evokes the idea of "childhood" for me - 5</td>', 'nice sunset, but nothing about this specifically evokes the idea of "childhood" for me - 5', '2008-01-28 15:17:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4433652, 636601, 22970, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, lighting, and focus. Simple but effective for the challenge. Good job</td>', 'Nice composition, lighting, and focus. Simple but effective for the challenge. Good job', '2008-01-28 15:18:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4433659, 635313, 69102, '<td valign="top">interesting - surreal; otherworldly</td>', 'interesting - surreal; otherworldly', '2008-01-28 15:19:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4433662, 637092, 69102, '<td valign="top">the effect is more threatening or jarring than dreamy</td>', 'the effect is more threatening or jarring than dreamy', '2008-01-28 15:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4433665, 635513, 69102, '<td valign="top">fun shot - well done</td>', 'fun shot - well done', '2008-01-28 15:20:11.000000', NULL, 1),
