(4433737, 634596, 22970, '<td valign="top">I wish I could give you a higher score because your subject is a nice childhood memory for many people. Unfortunately the focus is not up to par. The lighting is ok. There are several thing, IMO, that could have made this a good shot besides the technical flaws. One being a little more creative in composition while trying to make the lunch box (bucket) more of a memory instead of a snapshot. A creative title could have helped. <br/> <br/>I no where as good as the majority of the photographers here but if my comment helps in any way and you would like some input let me know. I will do my best.<br/> <br/>I wish you the best in this challenge and future ones as well.</td>', 'I wish I could give you a higher score because your subject is a nice childhood memory for many people. Unfortunately the focus is not up to par. The lighting is ok. There are several thing, IMO, that could have made this a good shot besides the technical flaws. One being a little more creative in composition while trying to make the lunch box (bucket) more of a memory instead of a snapshot. A creative title could have helped.  I no where as good as the majority of the photographers here but if my comment helps in any way and you would like some input let me know. I will do my best. I wish you the best in this challenge and future ones as well.', '2008-01-28 15:38:36.000000', NULL, 1),
