(4434600, 635282, 22970, '<td valign="top">Very interesting POV. Very good job of conveying a child''s perception of climbing the slide for the first time. "Intimidating" comes to mind in your photograph even without a title. Great Job!</td>', 'Very interesting POV. Very good job of conveying a child''s perception of climbing the slide for the first time. "Intimidating" comes to mind in your photograph even without a title. Great Job!', '2008-01-28 20:22:01.000000', NULL, 1),
