(4434900, 635830, 61961, '<td valign="top">Excellent concept.  Oddly the spilled milk barely reads.  The liquid doesn''t contrast with the table much, and it took a while for me to "see" the overturned glass.</td>', 'Excellent concept.  Oddly the spilled milk barely reads.  The liquid doesn''t contrast with the table much, and it took a while for me to "see" the overturned glass.', '2008-01-28 21:17:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4434914, 634155, 61961, '<td valign="top">Not to nitpick, but it does seem like a child''s hand, which sort of goes against the theme.  However, the place is a good childhood object for the challenge.</td>', 'Not to nitpick, but it does seem like a child''s hand, which sort of goes against the theme.  However, the place is a good childhood object for the challenge.', '2008-01-28 21:22:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4434985, 636600, 67152, '<td valign="top">There is a nice simplicity and crispness to this image.  I think you have done a nice job to show toys of childhood.<br/> <br/>From a technical side I think the image is very solid - good lighting, good use of dark background and decent composition.  If I were to adjust anything on the comp, I would recommend a bit less space on time and a bit more at the bottom.  And maybe for a childs toy, I would think a bit warmer setting might work a bit better than the dark background - this seems more like a studio stock shot for a catalog.<br/> <br/>From an emotive side, I think the fact that the toys are brand new actually hurts you - the ball, the toy, the animals don''t quite look loved yet.  Providing that extra emotive touch to an image like this would likely boost the image a lot.</td>', 'There is a nice simplicity and crispness to this image.  I think you have done a nice job to show toys of childhood. From a technical side I think the image is very solid - good lighting, good use of dark background and decent composition.  If I were to adjust anything on the comp, I would recommend a bit less space on time and a bit more at the bottom.  And maybe for a childs toy, I would think a bit warmer setting might work a bit better than the dark background - this seems more like a studio stock shot for a catalog. From an emotive side, I think the fact that the toys are brand new actually hurts you - the ball, the toy, the animals don''t quite look loved yet.  Providing that extra emotive touch to an image like this would likely boost the image a lot.', '2008-01-28 21:43:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4435042, 636953, 89424, '<td valign="top">Great use of contrast and movement! The form of the cup really adds to the quality of the picture.</td>', 'Great use of contrast and movement! The form of the cup really adds to the quality of the picture.', '2008-01-28 22:09:24.000000', NULL, 1),
