(4435174, 635469, 62787, '<td valign="top">The title made me laugh :)<br/>Otherwise - good picture, but I find that the blue rail with the drops in the foreground commands so much attention that it detracts from the basic subject of the picture rather than enhancing it. (i.e. makes you think "blue rail with droplets" rather than "childhood"). That''s just my take on it though...</td>', 'The title made me laugh :)Otherwise - good picture, but I find that the blue rail with the drops in the foreground commands so much attention that it detracts from the basic subject of the picture rather than enhancing it. (i.e. makes you think "blue rail with droplets" rather than "childhood"). That''s just my take on it though...', '2008-01-28 22:56:33.000000', NULL, 1),
