(4435720, 636742, 88718, '<td valign="top">I find this a very dark photo with a number of burnt out highlights.</td>', 'I find this a very dark photo with a number of burnt out highlights.', '2008-01-29 07:05:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4435723, 634705, 88718, '<td valign="top">This appears to have been cropped rather arbitrarily. No one toy gets the first focus.</td>', 'This appears to have been cropped rather arbitrarily. No one toy gets the first focus.', '2008-01-29 07:07:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4435769, 636601, 19831, '<td valign="top">Great image. It has a cool ''graphic'' feel, if you know what I mean. Good lighting and really good control of dof. Good compositionally too. Nice work.</td>', 'Great image. It has a cool ''graphic'' feel, if you know what I mean. Good lighting and really good control of dof. Good compositionally too. Nice work.', '2008-01-29 07:31:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4435826, 636518, 89431, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, your picture was a little too blurry though. Try backing up more or getting a lens made to take close up shots.</td>', 'Nice idea, your picture was a little too blurry though. Try backing up more or getting a lens made to take close up shots.', '2008-01-29 08:06:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4435834, 636849, 89431, '<td valign="top">Really nice composition and line. The string really makes you look all around the picture creating a good flow.</td>', 'Really nice composition and line. The string really makes you look all around the picture creating a good flow.', '2008-01-29 08:07:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4435839, 636865, 89431, '<td valign="top">Very empty and dark, I am not liking the amount of negative space and the lack of lighting.</td>', 'Very empty and dark, I am not liking the amount of negative space and the lack of lighting.', '2008-01-29 08:08:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4435845, 636813, 89431, '<td valign="top">I love the vibrant colors, it makes it seem a lot more childlike. The crayon and dolls are an element I remember from my own childhood, nice job!</td>', 'I love the vibrant colors, it makes it seem a lot more childlike. The crayon and dolls are an element I remember from my own childhood, nice job!', '2008-01-29 08:10:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4435854, 636971, 89431, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture, not a bit of blurriness all the shapes create a circle that my eye keeps following. I also think the lack of color works in this instance.</td>', 'Beautiful picture, not a bit of blurriness all the shapes create a circle that my eye keeps following. I also think the lack of color works in this instance.', '2008-01-29 08:11:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4435861, 634398, 89431, '<td valign="top">Your title made me laugh, but your picture is a little depressing. Not that that''s a bad thing though, I like your different angle that you choose to shoot from and the black &amp; white adds to the mood.</td>', 'Your title made me laugh, but your picture is a little depressing. Not that that''s a bad thing though, I like your different angle that you choose to shoot from and the black & white adds to the mood.', '2008-01-29 08:14:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4435863, 634503, 89431, '<td valign="top">The textures in your picture are very strong and the detail is amazing. I like the zig zag line you created for the eye to follow.</td>', 'The textures in your picture are very strong and the detail is amazing. I like the zig zag line you created for the eye to follow.', '2008-01-29 08:16:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4435897, 635537, 89431, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful picture with alot of happy childlike colors. I like the angle and cropping.</td>', 'This is a beautiful picture with alot of happy childlike colors. I like the angle and cropping.', '2008-01-29 08:38:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4435923, 634294, 89431, '<td valign="top">I like the repetion of lines and contrast.</td>', 'I like the repetion of lines and contrast.', '2008-01-29 08:48:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4435931, 635314, 89431, '<td valign="top">I don''t really see any bit of childhood just a person jumping... The legs and hands are blurry which makes the whole thing look messy.</td>', 'I don''t really see any bit of childhood just a person jumping... The legs and hands are blurry which makes the whole thing look messy.', '2008-01-29 08:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4435936, 634235, 89431, '<td valign="top">I love your lighting but be careful with the contrast it kind of makes your sculpture lose its shape because the shadows are so dark and the highlights are so bright.</td>', 'I love your lighting but be careful with the contrast it kind of makes your sculpture lose its shape because the shadows are so dark and the highlights are so bright.', '2008-01-29 08:52:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4435944, 636837, 89431, '<td valign="top">The colors are beautiful and the  detail in the shapes is gorgeous, it just doesn''t say "childhood" to me.</td>', 'The colors are beautiful and the  detail in the shapes is gorgeous, it just doesn''t say "childhood" to me.', '2008-01-29 08:53:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4435946, 637067, 89431, '<td valign="top">This is a cool photograph i like how you created movement.</td>', 'This is a cool photograph i like how you created movement.', '2008-01-29 08:54:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4435950, 634444, 89431, '<td valign="top">Love the colors, love how the emphasis is on the slinky and the background is just black.</td>', 'Love the colors, love how the emphasis is on the slinky and the background is just black.', '2008-01-29 08:54:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4435956, 636877, 89431, '<td valign="top">I like how you were able to create a picture with so much texture and so many things going on by only using one color. nice job!</td>', 'I like how you were able to create a picture with so much texture and so many things going on by only using one color. nice job!', '2008-01-29 08:55:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4435961, 636557, 89431, '<td valign="top">The detail in the cookies is really nice, I wish the rest of the picture wasn''t so blurry.</td>', 'The detail in the cookies is really nice, I wish the rest of the picture wasn''t so blurry.', '2008-01-29 08:57:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4435969, 636604, 89431, '<td valign="top">I love the lighting and the way you set up the image down to the angle!</td>', 'I love the lighting and the way you set up the image down to the angle!', '2008-01-29 08:58:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4435972, 637031, 89431, '<td valign="top">this is a little dull and lifeless, not really giving me the feeling of childhood, not a good one anyway.</td>', 'this is a little dull and lifeless, not really giving me the feeling of childhood, not a good one anyway.', '2008-01-29 08:58:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4435978, 635345, 89431, '<td valign="top">This would be a great photo if i could only see the rest of it. Nice choice of colors and theme. The angle is also great just <u>extremely</u> blurry!</td>', 'This would be a great photo if i could only see the rest of it. Nice choice of colors and theme. The angle is also great just extremely blurry!', '2008-01-29 09:00:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4435981, 634596, 89431, '<td valign="top">Very blurry, and very dull, the colors are bland and there really isn''t anything that pops. Maybe you could try another angle.</td>', 'Very blurry, and very dull, the colors are bland and there really isn''t anything that pops. Maybe you could try another angle.', '2008-01-29 09:01:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436026, 635338, 83165, '<td valign="top">Simple, but lovely :)</td>', 'Simple, but lovely :)', '2008-01-29 09:26:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436033, 637091, 83165, '<td valign="top">Oh, I love snow and i love this picture :D</td>', 'Oh, I love snow and i love this picture :D', '2008-01-29 09:28:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436037, 636737, 89427, '<td valign="top">I really like the movement and curved lines of this photograph. The contrast between yellow red and black creates a dramatic effect.</td>', 'I really like the movement and curved lines of this photograph. The contrast between yellow red and black creates a dramatic effect.', '2008-01-29 09:29:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436038, 635218, 89427, '<td valign="top">I like that the photograph was taken from a worms-eye perspective, and the emphasis on the training wheels.</td>', 'I like that the photograph was taken from a worms-eye perspective, and the emphasis on the training wheels.', '2008-01-29 09:31:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436040, 636503, 89427, '<td valign="top">I don''t perticularly like this photograph because nothing stands out. The colors are the same throughout the photograph and the composition is flat.</td>', 'I don''t perticularly like this photograph because nothing stands out. The colors are the same throughout the photograph and the composition is flat.', '2008-01-29 09:33:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436044, 635630, 89427, '<td valign="top">I like this photograph as a portrait, as well as the orange and red hues that catch the viewers eye.</td>', 'I like this photograph as a portrait, as well as the orange and red hues that catch the viewers eye.', '2008-01-29 09:34:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436045, 634558, 89417, '<td valign="top">follows the rule of thirds making the subject off center and has a good angle.</td>', 'follows the rule of thirds making the subject off center and has a good angle.', '2008-01-29 09:35:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436046, 636813, 89546, '<td valign="top">The colors pop out of the photograph, but the angle could have been more interesting.</td>', 'The colors pop out of the photograph, but the angle could have been more interesting.', '2008-01-29 09:35:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436048, 634451, 89427, '<td valign="top">I like that the lines in this photograph create a vanashing point in the distance and the emphasis on the first shoes and getting less detailed as the shoes move back.</td>', 'I like that the lines in this photograph create a vanashing point in the distance and the emphasis on the first shoes and getting less detailed as the shoes move back.', '2008-01-29 09:36:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436049, 635313, 89546, '<td valign="top">There is too much background space, it draws away from the slide.</td>', 'There is too much background space, it draws away from the slide.', '2008-01-29 09:36:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436055, 637085, 89427, '<td valign="top">I like that this picture was taken from the subjects level and your eye is drawn to the corner where Hobbes is because the lines draw you there. Overall this is a very interesting picture.</td>', 'I like that this picture was taken from the subjects level and your eye is drawn to the corner where Hobbes is because the lines draw you there. Overall this is a very interesting picture.', '2008-01-29 09:37:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436056, 634759, 89417, '<td valign="top">Has no real focal point, no creative angle or lines to guide your eyes through the photo.</td>', 'Has no real focal point, no creative angle or lines to guide your eyes through the photo.', '2008-01-29 09:37:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436058, 637076, 89546, '<td valign="top">The oreo in sharp focus in the corner draws your attention right to it. The picture is intersting, and the glass of milk in the background adds to it, especially since it is blurred.</td>', 'The oreo in sharp focus in the corner draws your attention right to it. The picture is intersting, and the glass of milk in the background adds to it, especially since it is blurred.', '2008-01-29 09:38:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436059, 636452, 89417, '<td valign="top">Has no creativity, it looks like the photographer just randomly took a picture</td>', 'Has no creativity, it looks like the photographer just randomly took a picture', '2008-01-29 09:38:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436060, 636973, 89427, '<td valign="top">I dislike this picture because it looks like a snapshot. The composition is poor and the angle of the shot is not interesting.</td>', 'I dislike this picture because it looks like a snapshot. The composition is poor and the angle of the shot is not interesting.', '2008-01-29 09:38:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436061, 637091, 89420, '<td valign="top">I like the diverse grey scale from the white snow to the black handel bars. I also like that the snow is still falling and how it has clung to the weel.</td>', 'I like the diverse grey scale from the white snow to the black handel bars. I also like that the snow is still falling and how it has clung to the weel.', '2008-01-29 09:38:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436064, 634500, 89427, '<td valign="top">I like this photograph because it is creative. The lighting against the doll''s dress is very soft, and the angle the photograph was taken is very interesting.</td>', 'I like this photograph because it is creative. The lighting against the doll''s dress is very soft, and the angle the photograph was taken is very interesting.', '2008-01-29 09:39:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436065, 635282, 89546, '<td valign="top">Would have been more appealing in color. The angle is interesting and the shadows add a lot to the picture.</td>', 'Would have been more appealing in color. The angle is interesting and the shadows add a lot to the picture.', '2008-01-29 09:39:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436067, 634408, 89417, '<td valign="top">I like how the cupcake is half eaten, it adds texture, also the black backround makes the plate and cupcake more important, nice camera angle.</td>', 'I like how the cupcake is half eaten, it adds texture, also the black backround makes the plate and cupcake more important, nice camera angle.', '2008-01-29 09:41:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436070, 637117, 89427, '<td valign="top">The levels and composition in this photograph are very good. The tricyle is the main subject against a backdrop that makes the mood of the photograph very dreary.</td>', 'The levels and composition in this photograph are very good. The tricyle is the main subject against a backdrop that makes the mood of the photograph very dreary.', '2008-01-29 09:41:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436072, 636953, 89427, '<td valign="top">I really like this photograph because the movement and lines of the glass.</td>', 'I really like this photograph because the movement and lines of the glass.', '2008-01-29 09:43:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436073, 637114, 89422, '<td valign="top">Although this is a fantasticly taken shot, without explination I don''t think it can really be connected to typical childhood.</td>', 'Although this is a fantasticly taken shot, without explination I don''t think it can really be connected to typical childhood.', '2008-01-29 09:43:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436074, 636889, 89546, '<td valign="top">The milk in the corner takes away from the picture. Draws your eye there instead of to the oreos. Moving the milk more in the picture and putting it in focus could have turned out better.</td>', 'The milk in the corner takes away from the picture. Draws your eye there instead of to the oreos. Moving the milk more in the picture and putting it in focus could have turned out better.', '2008-01-29 09:43:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436078, 637091, 89417, '<td valign="top">Great range of values, the snowflakes add a feeling of tranquility.</td>', 'Great range of values, the snowflakes add a feeling of tranquility.', '2008-01-29 09:44:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436079, 636971, 89420, '<td valign="top">This photo is good. It gives the appearence of abandonment. My eyes travel from the fountain to the bars then cut across the image. Also the contrast of the dark trees and the white sky helps out as well.</td>', 'This photo is good. It gives the appearence of abandonment. My eyes travel from the fountain to the bars then cut across the image. Also the contrast of the dark trees and the white sky helps out as well.', '2008-01-29 09:44:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436080, 636518, 89422, '<td valign="top">Wonderful idea, but the little pilot is half in focus and half out, and i looks a little wierd.</td>', 'Wonderful idea, but the little pilot is half in focus and half out, and i looks a little wierd.', '2008-01-29 09:44:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436082, 636737, 89546, '<td valign="top">The reflection of the headlights on the track is neat. With the dark background the yellow and red cars pop.</td>', 'The reflection of the headlights on the track is neat. With the dark background the yellow and red cars pop.', '2008-01-29 09:45:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436084, 637117, 89422, '<td valign="top">It certainly looks like you took the perfect opportunity. Nice Job.</td>', 'It certainly looks like you took the perfect opportunity. Nice Job.', '2008-01-29 09:45:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436085, 634178, 89422, '<td valign="top">I have a personal soft spot for sunsets, but i don''t seen any connnection to the theme of the shoot.</td>', 'I have a personal soft spot for sunsets, but i don''t seen any connnection to the theme of the shoot.', '2008-01-29 09:46:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436086, 635996, 89546, '<td valign="top">The angle is interesting and the shoes add so much to the picture.</td>', 'The angle is interesting and the shoes add so much to the picture.', '2008-01-29 09:46:35.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4436087, 634697, 89546, '<td valign="top">The moving swings are very well place, but it is hard to see them against the dark background of the trees.</td>', 'The moving swings are very well place, but it is hard to see them against the dark background of the trees.', '2008-01-29 09:47:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436089, 635842, 89546, '<td valign="top">Picture is really blurry, it is hard to determine what it is.</td>', 'Picture is really blurry, it is hard to determine what it is.', '2008-01-29 09:47:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436090, 634451, 89422, '<td valign="top">Nice broad color range throughout the picture, and very eye-catching.</td>', 'Nice broad color range throughout the picture, and very eye-catching.', '2008-01-29 09:47:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436091, 637024, 89423, '<td valign="top">I like the angle because it''s different and it kind of makes you feel like things are just slipping away without children.</td>', 'I like the angle because it''s different and it kind of makes you feel like things are just slipping away without children.', '2008-01-29 09:48:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436094, 636451, 89546, '<td valign="top">The track of the bouncy ball is beautifully captured. The colors all stand out against the background.</td>', 'The track of the bouncy ball is beautifully captured. The colors all stand out against the background.', '2008-01-29 09:49:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436096, 635659, 89422, '<td valign="top">There should be no connection to alchoholism and childhood. Unless this is a psychopathic kid growing up to be a serial killer, this picture doesn''t connect to the shoot at all.</td>', 'There should be no connection to alchoholism and childhood. Unless this is a psychopathic kid growing up to be a serial killer, this picture doesn''t connect to the shoot at all.', '2008-01-29 09:49:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436097, 634503, 89422, '<td valign="top">Nothing captures childhood quite like burning things with a magnifying glass. Nice one.</td>', 'Nothing captures childhood quite like burning things with a magnifying glass. Nice one.', '2008-01-29 09:50:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436098, 635314, 89420, '<td valign="top">This photo isnt very good it is not a child who is jumping. The photo shoot is childhoos with out children. First she is clearly not a child. Second this photo has someone in it so it does not meet the requirments</td>', 'This photo isnt very good it is not a child who is jumping. The photo shoot is childhoos with out children. First she is clearly not a child. Second this photo has someone in it so it does not meet the requirments', '2008-01-29 09:50:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436099, 637117, 89423, '<td valign="top">I like the vacancy and how no is around and the loneliness to it.</td>', 'I like the vacancy and how no is around and the loneliness to it.', '2008-01-29 09:50:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436101, 637030, 89422, '<td valign="top">Very vivid colors and good focus. Thank you so much, you just made me hungry.</td>', 'Very vivid colors and good focus. Thank you so much, you just made me hungry.', '2008-01-29 09:52:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436102, 636837, 89422, '<td valign="top">I really like the colors in this picture. I thought I was looking at some sort of cell in a microscope at first.</td>', 'I really like the colors in this picture. I thought I was looking at some sort of cell in a microscope at first.', '2008-01-29 09:53:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436103, 634444, 89422, '<td valign="top">The cololrs are always nice, but just a slink really isn''t all that creative.</td>', 'The cololrs are always nice, but just a slink really isn''t all that creative.', '2008-01-29 09:54:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436104, 634558, 89423, '<td valign="top">The silence on the beach is interesting and how the swing is rusty and old, but if the swing could have had more motion to it, it would of given it the feeling of vacancy and no ones around to use it at all.</td>', 'The silence on the beach is interesting and how the swing is rusty and old, but if the swing could have had more motion to it, it would of given it the feeling of vacancy and no ones around to use it at all.', '2008-01-29 09:54:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436105, 635537, 89422, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting used in this one, and the clouds make an interesting background.</td>', 'I like the lighting used in this one, and the clouds make an interesting background.', '2008-01-29 09:55:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436107, 637072, 89422, '<td valign="top">I really hope your childhood didn''t look like this. Almost a gloomy picture.</td>', 'I really hope your childhood didn''t look like this. Almost a gloomy picture.', '2008-01-29 09:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436109, 635063, 89420, '<td valign="top">This photo is prety good. i like the way every thing looks like it has been laying there for a while.</td>', 'This photo is prety good. i like the way every thing looks like it has been laying there for a while.', '2008-01-29 09:56:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436110, 636849, 89423, '<td valign="top">This on makes me sad...but it was a very good idea useing the cans because that''s something that little kids would do.</td>', 'This on makes me sad...but it was a very good idea useing the cans because that''s something that little kids would do.', '2008-01-29 09:56:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436113, 636965, 89422, '<td valign="top">It doesn''t look like you put much thought into doing this. It looks thrown together.</td>', 'It doesn''t look like you put much thought into doing this. It looks thrown together.', '2008-01-29 09:56:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436116, 636838, 89423, '<td valign="top">I like the motion to the picture and how it looks like it''s spinning. I also like the colors in it.</td>', 'I like the motion to the picture and how it looks like it''s spinning. I also like the colors in it.', '2008-01-29 09:57:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436118, 636320, 89423, '<td valign="top">I like the motion, but the person in the go-cart...does really say a <i>childhood without children</i>to me</td>', 'I like the motion, but the person in the go-cart...does really say a childhood without childrento me', '2008-01-29 09:58:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436126, 635826, 89423, '<td valign="top">A fun activity and a game that a lot of kids play</td>', 'A fun activity and a game that a lot of kids play', '2008-01-29 10:01:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436132, 637040, 89423, '<td valign="top">It''s pretty. I like the idea of useing the merry-go-round because that''s something that a lot of little kids enjoy.</td>', 'It''s pretty. I like the idea of useing the merry-go-round because that''s something that a lot of little kids enjoy.', '2008-01-29 10:04:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436135, 635063, 89423, '<td valign="top">It shows emptyness and loneliness. I also like that the <i>Little Red Wagon</i>is tipped over on it''s side it gives you the feeling that is was just abandoned.</td>', 'It shows emptyness and loneliness. I also like that the Little Red Wagonis tipped over on it''s side it gives you the feeling that is was just abandoned.', '2008-01-29 10:06:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436142, 635314, 89423, '<td valign="top">It''s an intesting picture, but why "Jumping for joy!"? And how is the body clear, but when you look at the legs and the feet, they''re really blurry?</td>', 'It''s an intesting picture, but why "Jumping for joy!"? And how is the body clear, but when you look at the legs and the feet, they''re really blurry?', '2008-01-29 10:09:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436145, 634570, 89423, '<td valign="top">I like the empty bikes by the painted wall, but it kinda say''s "childeren are going to becoeming soon! Yay!"</td>', 'I like the empty bikes by the painted wall, but it kinda say''s "childeren are going to becoeming soon! Yay!"', '2008-01-29 10:10:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436148, 636609, 89423, '<td valign="top">I can see why you used a gun and like the background, but why in the woods?</td>', 'I can see why you used a gun and like the background, but why in the woods?', '2008-01-29 10:11:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436151, 636616, 89423, '<td valign="top">I really like the idea of the use of dippers, it''s different and unique, but it''s kind of plain</td>', 'I really like the idea of the use of dippers, it''s different and unique, but it''s kind of plain', '2008-01-29 10:12:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436154, 635282, 89423, '<td valign="top">Yes, always the big slid climbs are very  scary and intimidating, and it has a sort of vancant feeling</td>', 'Yes, always the big slid climbs are very  scary and intimidating, and it has a sort of vancant feeling', '2008-01-29 10:13:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436157, 636604, 89423, '<td valign="top">The teddy bear looks sad and lonely just sitting there all by himself with the blocks waiting for someone to come along and play with him. And I like the concept of just haveing a light shone on the bear and blocks.</td>', 'The teddy bear looks sad and lonely just sitting there all by himself with the blocks waiting for someone to come along and play with him. And I like the concept of just haveing a light shone on the bear and blocks.', '2008-01-29 10:15:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436687, 636876, 66384, '<td valign="top">I like the one swing being out of line. The image as a whole could be much better. Focus is too soft, light is too harsh, with the sky blown out, and the contrast and color are flat. A basic levels adjustment would do a lot to improve the quality of this image, but the focus must be done during capture.</td>', 'I like the one swing being out of line. The image as a whole could be much better. Focus is too soft, light is too harsh, with the sky blown out, and the contrast and color are flat. A basic levels adjustment would do a lot to improve the quality of this image, but the focus must be done during capture.', '2008-01-29 13:37:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436692, 636433, 66384, '<td valign="top">nice composition, and subject, but the white balance seems off. There is an overall gray feeling to this image. The cookies and milk look dull. I think a bright colored background would have improved this shot significantly.</td>', 'nice composition, and subject, but the white balance seems off. There is an overall gray feeling to this image. The cookies and milk look dull. I think a bright colored background would have improved this shot significantly.', '2008-01-29 13:42:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436703, 637037, 66384, '<td valign="top">Nice focus, contrast, and colors. It feels like the top of the image is cut off. I''m not sure if that is because of all the vertical lines or because of the negative space at the bottom. It makes me wonder how this scene would look with a diagonal composition.</td>', 'Nice focus, contrast, and colors. It feels like the top of the image is cut off. I''m not sure if that is because of all the vertical lines or because of the negative space at the bottom. It makes me wonder how this scene would look with a diagonal composition.', '2008-01-29 13:46:42.000000', NULL, 1),
