(4437286, 636307, 80058, '<td valign="top">Did you see somethin like this when you were a child? I adore this image for many reasons: the sepia quality is brilliant, great conversion, what speaks to me about this photo is that it really reminds me of a child remembering a special moment that they saw... in this case the leaping fish, it brings out this whole being so imaginative phase that I think every child has, the photo itself is fabulous too, I love how the dof works on this too... I can imagine this leap being somethin tht happened quickly so the dof adds to the feeling of a half forgotten thing that happened but that it truly stayed in your memories. Seriously amazing stuff this, I hope others can read as much I did!!!! 10!<br/> <br/>Best of luck and faved!!</td>', 'Did you see somethin like this when you were a child? I adore this image for many reasons: the sepia quality is brilliant, great conversion, what speaks to me about this photo is that it really reminds me of a child remembering a special moment that they saw... in this case the leaping fish, it brings out this whole being so imaginative phase that I think every child has, the photo itself is fabulous too, I love how the dof works on this too... I can imagine this leap being somethin tht happened quickly so the dof adds to the feeling of a half forgotten thing that happened but that it truly stayed in your memories. Seriously amazing stuff this, I hope others can read as much I did!!!! 10! Best of luck and faved!!', '2008-01-29 18:00:34.000000', NULL, 1),
