(4438096, 634288, 16531, '<td valign="top">Way to go girl top 20 at your first try Congrats ,This was one of my 10 votes in this challenge :)</td>', 'Way to go girl top 20 at your first try Congrats ,This was one of my 10 votes in this challenge :)', '2008-01-30 00:04:17.000000', NULL, 0),
