(4438423, 635313, 75958, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by boyd2000:</b></div><hr/><i> I really like this shot.  Congratulations on honorable mention.  I didn''t vote in this challenge, because I entered it, but I just wanted to make a point that the missing "h" in the title may have cost you a ribbon (about .015 point).  Maybe it''s not fair for a photography competition, but I usually deduct a point for a title typo, figuring it shows lack of care. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Yeah after the challenge started I noticed that and really wanted to fix it this whole week, wasn''t because of lack of care more lack of time. you really shouldn''t deduct points for spelling errors in titles as you never know if the artists meant to miss spell it.</td>', 'Originally posted by boyd2000: I really like this shot.  Congratulations on honorable mention.  I didn''t vote in this challenge, because I entered it, but I just wanted to make a point that the missing "h" in the title may have cost you a ribbon (about .015 point).  Maybe it''s not fair for a photography competition, but I usually deduct a point for a title typo, figuring it shows lack of care.   Yeah after the challenge started I noticed that and really wanted to fix it this whole week, wasn''t because of lack of care more lack of time. you really shouldn''t deduct points for spelling errors in titles as you never know if the artists meant to miss spell it.', '2008-01-30 01:58:19.000000', NULL, 0),
