(4438693, 636307, 80058, '<td valign="top">Grrrrrrrr I''m mad for you!! This truly deserved to be on the front page!! I saw so much in this shot it''s frustrating that nobody else stopped to think about it. That''s a slight fault with the voters here... I explained why I loved this shot! Congratulations on having a superb concept on your first entry, you know after a while (in the site) you get to learn that even if your photo doesn''t score very well... all the faves and all the people that understood makes this en enjoyable experience =]<br/> <br/>Looking forward to see you in more entries!</td>', 'Grrrrrrrr I''m mad for you!! This truly deserved to be on the front page!! I saw so much in this shot it''s frustrating that nobody else stopped to think about it. That''s a slight fault with the voters here... I explained why I loved this shot! Congratulations on having a superb concept on your first entry, you know after a while (in the site) you get to learn that even if your photo doesn''t score very well... all the faves and all the people that understood makes this en enjoyable experience =] Looking forward to see you in more entries!', '2008-01-30 06:34:56.000000', NULL, 0),
