(4438777, 636616, 53147, '<td valign="top">I didnt vote in this challenge but I probably would have scored this a 5. I know what they are for sure (and I am so looking forward to not having to have them in my house anymore). The composition is a bit boring. I understand that it might be an ad type layout but it just seems flat and uninspired to me. Maybe the stack of pullups like you have behind and then a package of the Kandoos wipes or something. The shot just needs something else. Different angle, different layout, something to make it more than just a straight on shot. 4.5 may be a bit harsh, it is in focus and the colors are decent, but I wouldnt have expected much higher into the 5s.</td>', 'I didnt vote in this challenge but I probably would have scored this a 5. I know what they are for sure (and I am so looking forward to not having to have them in my house anymore). The composition is a bit boring. I understand that it might be an ad type layout but it just seems flat and uninspired to me. Maybe the stack of pullups like you have behind and then a package of the Kandoos wipes or something. The shot just needs something else. Different angle, different layout, something to make it more than just a straight on shot. 4.5 may be a bit harsh, it is in focus and the colors are decent, but I wouldnt have expected much higher into the 5s.', '2008-01-30 07:02:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(4438792, 636616, 70689, '<td valign="top">After-voting-ended-comment-on-request: I  gave this one a 6, and ence think it deserved better than 4.5ish. I think the idea is orginal (between all the toys and swings and milk&amp;cookies) and the technicallities are okay. And yes, I did recognize diapers, I have a two year old and a 4 year old at home. I think it could have improved by creating a little more depth, for instance by using a different angle, or by putting the stacks behind each other in stead of next to each other.</td>', 'After-voting-ended-comment-on-request: I  gave this one a 6, and ence think it deserved better than 4.5ish. I think the idea is orginal (between all the toys and swings and milk&cookies) and the technicallities are okay. And yes, I did recognize diapers, I have a two year old and a 4 year old at home. I think it could have improved by creating a little more depth, for instance by using a different angle, or by putting the stacks behind each other in stead of next to each other.', '2008-01-30 07:07:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(4438797, 636616, 43774, '<td valign="top">Yes I knew what they were and I also knew where your title came from (the commercial). I gave this a 6 which is sort of high for me. I don''t think it is all that interesting, just some pull-ups, no fancy lighting, nothing to wow the viewer. Sorry. But you got a 6 because it was clear and it fit the challegne.</td>', 'Yes I knew what they were and I also knew where your title came from (the commercial). I gave this a 6 which is sort of high for me. I don''t think it is all that interesting, just some pull-ups, no fancy lighting, nothing to wow the viewer. Sorry. But you got a 6 because it was clear and it fit the challegne.', '2008-01-30 07:08:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(4438810, 635313, 53147, '<td valign="top">Just an FYI - I have misspelled my titles before and realized after it went into vote. If you send a PM to SC they will fix it for you. In fact they may still fix it now if you ask.<br/> <br/>And congrats on 4th!</td>', 'Just an FYI - I have misspelled my titles before and realized after it went into vote. If you send a PM to SC they will fix it for you. In fact they may still fix it now if you ask. And congrats on 4th!', '2008-01-30 07:12:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(4438812, 636616, 67258, '<td valign="top">I gave you a 4 - I had no idea what the nappies were, and thought perhaps they were toy bags or something similar!  As for the link to the comercial, remember that will only apply to American viewers!  In terms of the photo itself, I simply found it dull and uninspiring - sorry...</td>', 'I gave you a 4 - I had no idea what the nappies were, and thought perhaps they were toy bags or something similar!  As for the link to the comercial, remember that will only apply to American viewers!  In terms of the photo itself, I simply found it dull and uninspiring - sorry...', '2008-01-30 07:14:12.000000', NULL, 0),
