(4439052, 637024, 30049, '<td valign="top">I never got around to commenting on images for this challenge and certainly wanted to come back to this one.  It was my top pick for the challenge.  :-)<br/> <br/>For this to not reach at least a score of 6 is bizzare IMO.  The DOF is perfect.  The stone you selected is a great color choice for the pavement background.  Very nice touch on the angle to show enough of the hopscotch "board" to tell the story.<br/> <br/>All around, a very nice piece of work.</td>', 'I never got around to commenting on images for this challenge and certainly wanted to come back to this one.  It was my top pick for the challenge.  :-) For this to not reach at least a score of 6 is bizzare IMO.  The DOF is perfect.  The stone you selected is a great color choice for the pavement background.  Very nice touch on the angle to show enough of the hopscotch "board" to tell the story. All around, a very nice piece of work.', '2008-01-30 08:54:27.000000', NULL, 0),
