(4439613, 636468, 811, '<td valign="top">Makes sense to me.  What is more symbolic of childhood than those little rides outside of stores.  AND, this one is unoccupied.  Perhaps that guy in the upper left used to be one of those kids that never got to get the quarter to ride the little car.  Maybe he is standing there sadly remembering that he never got to ride in the car.<br/> <br/>Oh yea, the picture.  I think it is very well balanced compositionally.  And, while I''m glad my score was higher than yours (hahahaha), I really like this shot.  The more I look at it, the more I think it is very well done, and very much under appreciated.</td>', 'Makes sense to me.  What is more symbolic of childhood than those little rides outside of stores.  AND, this one is unoccupied.  Perhaps that guy in the upper left used to be one of those kids that never got to get the quarter to ride the little car.  Maybe he is standing there sadly remembering that he never got to ride in the car. Oh yea, the picture.  I think it is very well balanced compositionally.  And, while I''m glad my score was higher than yours (hahahaha), I really like this shot.  The more I look at it, the more I think it is very well done, and very much under appreciated.', '2008-01-30 11:03:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(4439661, 636616, 72268, '<td valign="top">It''s funny to see how different people respond to a challenge theme. I would have recognized it and scored it a 7 because this really does represent childhood, however, I think people were looking for more creativity. This photo is technically good, except i think the colors are a little flat, and it is a little dark for my taste. I think composition wise, it could be better. If I were you, I would try it again, but in a different composition. Different angles, and not so symetrical.</td>', 'It''s funny to see how different people respond to a challenge theme. I would have recognized it and scored it a 7 because this really does represent childhood, however, I think people were looking for more creativity. This photo is technically good, except i think the colors are a little flat, and it is a little dark for my taste. I think composition wise, it could be better. If I were you, I would try it again, but in a different composition. Different angles, and not so symetrical.', '2008-01-30 11:17:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(4439691, 634697, 67697, '<td valign="top">I didn''t vote or enter in this challenge but I will say that I had a pic ready to go - and it was of a swing! lol  I like how you have the top of the swing coming diagonally into the picture.  I also like the criss-cross of the moving swings.  Parts of the seats do blend into the background, but what ya gonna do?  I also like the contrast of the ground - it really brings out the texture of the wood shavings.</td>', 'I didn''t vote or enter in this challenge but I will say that I had a pic ready to go - and it was of a swing! lol  I like how you have the top of the swing coming diagonally into the picture.  I also like the criss-cross of the moving swings.  Parts of the seats do blend into the background, but what ya gonna do?  I also like the contrast of the ground - it really brings out the texture of the wood shavings.', '2008-01-30 11:29:12.000000', NULL, 0),
