(4439732, 636616, 42171, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by SaraR:</b></div><hr/><i>As for the link to the comercial, remember that will only apply to American viewers</i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Not true - I remember that Tag line in the UK ads...<br/> <br/>I didn''t vote this challenge, though if I did, I would have probably voted a 4.<br/>Lighting seems very harsh and direct.<br/>I don''t like the composition - It is a little un-interesting.<br/>Might have worked better without the two nappies up front, though that may have made it even more difficult for people to recognise.</td>', 'Originally posted by SaraR:As for the link to the comercial, remember that will only apply to American viewers  Not true - I remember that Tag line in the UK ads... I didn''t vote this challenge, though if I did, I would have probably voted a 4.Lighting seems very harsh and direct.I don''t like the composition - It is a little un-interesting.Might have worked better without the two nappies up front, though that may have made it even more difficult for people to recognise.', '2008-01-30 11:39:30.000000', NULL, 0),
