(4439986, 635313, 75958, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by timfythetoo:</b></div><hr/><i> Just an FYI - I have misspelled my titles before and realized after it went into vote. If you send a PM to SC they will fix it for you. In fact they may still fix it now if you ask.<br/> <br/>And congrats on 4th! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I choose to leave it!TO remind me of the spelling gestapo (I think thats how its spelled). And because I meant to do it...</td>', 'Originally posted by timfythetoo: Just an FYI - I have misspelled my titles before and realized after it went into vote. If you send a PM to SC they will fix it for you. In fact they may still fix it now if you ask. And congrats on 4th!   I choose to leave it!TO remind me of the spelling gestapo (I think thats how its spelled). And because I meant to do it...', '2008-01-30 12:47:15.000000', NULL, 0),
