(4465863, 634941, 82814, '<td valign="top">This a wonderful idea for the challenge and a well executed submission.  I think it deserved a little higher than 5.4 as an overall score.  The composition, colour, clarity and DOF are perfect.  One commenter stated that the reflection was a distraction rather than an addition to the image...they are not appreciating that the reflection is the 1/3rd of the image that gives it a rule of thirds composition - an oversight maybe, or just being picky?...who knows?</td>', 'This a wonderful idea for the challenge and a well executed submission.  I think it deserved a little higher than 5.4 as an overall score.  The composition, colour, clarity and DOF are perfect.  One commenter stated that the reflection was a distraction rather than an addition to the image...they are not appreciating that the reflection is the 1/3rd of the image that gives it a rule of thirds composition - an oversight maybe, or just being picky?...who knows?', '2008-02-06 19:05:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470302, 636307, 89135, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by booboo_goon:</b></div><hr/><i> Grrrrrrrr I''m mad for you!! This truly deserved to be on the front page!! I saw so much in this shot it''s frustrating that nobody else stopped to think about it. That''s a slight fault with the voters here... I explained why I loved this shot! Congratulations on having a superb concept on your first entry, you know after a while (in the site) you get to learn that even if your photo doesn''t score very well... all the faves and all the people that understood makes this en enjoyable experience =]<br/> <br/>Looking forward to see you in more entries! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>awwww, thank you so much.. =)</td>', 'Originally posted by booboo_goon: Grrrrrrrr I''m mad for you!! This truly deserved to be on the front page!! I saw so much in this shot it''s frustrating that nobody else stopped to think about it. That''s a slight fault with the voters here... I explained why I loved this shot! Congratulations on having a superb concept on your first entry, you know after a while (in the site) you get to learn that even if your photo doesn''t score very well... all the faves and all the people that understood makes this en enjoyable experience =] Looking forward to see you in more entries!   awwww, thank you so much.. =)', '2008-02-08 04:14:12.000000', NULL, 0),
